happy, whether it\'s large or tiny. It\'ll help us conquer the struggles we encounter."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 54,\n    "timestamp": "August 07, 2023(Monday) at 07:59 PM",\n    "messages": "Sam: Nice! What made you decide to get that?\\nEvan: I got this because it symbolizes strength and resilience. Taking care of it motivates me to keep going through tough times."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 55,\n    "timestamp": "August 07, 2023(Monday) at 08:00 PM",\n    "messages": "Sam: Wow, it\'s amazing! So powerful yet so simple.\\nEvan: Thanks, Sam. It\'s a reminder that even in little things, we can be tough."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 56,\n    "timestamp": "August 07, 2023(Monday) at 08:01 PM",\n    "messages": "Sam: Little stuff matters - it builds our resilience over time.\\nEvan: Yeah, every little thing we do for ourselves helps us in the long run.\\nSam: Yep, small steps add up. Stay consistent and don\'t give up!\\nEvan: Yep, Sam! Consistency and perseverance will get us far. Great chat!"\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 57,\n    "timestamp": "August 07, 2023(Monday) at 08:03 PM",\n    "messages": "Sam: Great chatting with you, Sam! Take care, talk soon!\\nEvan: Catch ya later!"\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 58,\n    "timestamp": "August 13, 2023(Sunday) at 04:09 PM",\n    "messages": "Evan: Evan shared an image: a photo of a tent pitched up in a grassy field Hey Sam, long time no talk! Hope you\'re doing great. I just got back from a rad vacay with my new SO in Canada. Tried some awesome activities too - think hiking, biking... all that cool stuff. We loved exploring the outdoors together, it was so awesome!\\nSam: Hey Evan! Good to hear from you. Wow, Canada sounds amazing! That photo looks stunning. Wish I could do something like that. Things have been a bit challenging for me lately; some stuff has been hard on my health."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 59,\n    "timestamp": "August 13, 2023(Sunday) at 04:10 PM",\n    "messages": "Evan: Sorry to hear that things haven\'t