 such a positive change. Keep up the good work!"\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 78,\n    "timestamp": "August 19, 2023(Saturday) at 06:19 PM",\n    "messages": "Evan: And speaking of healthy meals, do you have any favorite recipes you\'d like to share?\\nSam: [Sam shared an image: a photo of two bowls of food with chopsticks and sauce] Sure, I\'m loving this recipe I found. It\'s a flavorful and healthy grilled chicken and veggie stir-fry. Wanna give it a go?\\nEvan: Mmm, looks yummy! Is the sauce a family secret? I\'m always down to try new recipes!\\nSam: Nah, it\'s just my homemade sauce. Want the recipe?\\nEvan: Yeah, I\'d love to! Thanks for sharing the recipe.\\nSam: [Sam shared an image: a photography of a recipe card with a drawing of a vase of flowers] Sure thing! Here\'s the recipe. Let me know how it went!"\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 79,\n    "timestamp": "August 19, 2023(Saturday) at 06:22 PM",\n    "messages": "Evan: Thanks Sam! I\'ll give it a shot and let you know how it went. Trying out new recipes is a great way to stay busy and creative."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 80,\n    "timestamp": "August 19, 2023(Saturday) at 06:22 PM",\n    "messages": "Evan: By the way, I also started taking a painting classes few days ago and I\'m really enjoying it. It\'s all about trying new things, right?\\nSam: You\'re already good at drawing, why did you decide to join a class? And why did you start painting then years ago anyway?\\nEvan: [Evan shared an image: a photo of a painting of a forest scene on a easel] Thanks, Sam! It all started when a friend of mine gave me this painting one day, it inspired me a lot and that\'s when I started painting. And I joined the classes to find like-minded people and show them what I can do, you can always improve your skills.\\nSam: Wow, that\'s awesome! You\'re really talented. Did you take any other classes?\\nEvan: [Evan shared an image: a photo of a brush, pencil, and eyeliners on a cloth] Thanks, Sam! Just been painting with these for now, but might look into other classes. It\'s awesome for finding my peace and expressing myself!"\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 81,\n    "timestamp": "August 19, 2023(Saturday) at 06:25 PM",\n    "messages": "Sam: Cool, Evan! What have you been learning in those classes?\\nEvan: [Evan shared an image: a photo of a table with a bunch of watercolors on it] In painting classes, we\'ve been learning about watercolors. The instructor stresses observing nature and painting what we see. It\'s a relaxing way to take a break from everyday stress.\\nSam: Wow, Evan! What type of nature do you enjoy painting the most?\\nEvan: [Evan shared an image: a photo of a painting of a sunset over the ocean] I love painting landscapes. Nature\'s beauty captivates me and brings me peace. Here\'s one of my recent works."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 82,\n    "timestamp": "August 19, 2023(Saturday) at 06:27 PM",\n    "messages": "Sam: Wow, Evan! The colors are so bright. How do you capture the tranquil beauty of nature in your paintings?\\nEvan: [Evan shared an image: a photo of a tree with pink flowers in a field] Thanks Sam! I aim to capture the vibe of nature in my paintings, conveying the peacefulness of being outdoors.\\nSam: Wow, that pic is great! Do you often spend time in places like this?\\nEvan: [Evan shared an image: a photography of a truck parked in the middle of a forest] Thanks! I love being in places like this - it brings back memories of road tripping in my trusty car."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 83,\n    "timestamp": "August 19, 2023(Saturday) at 06:29 PM",\n    "messages": "Sam: Wow, that\'s cool! Have you been to any fun places in that ride?\\nEvan: [Evan shared an image: a photo of a person on skis on a snowy trail] Yep, last month I drove somewhere fun. The views were amazing!\\nSam: Did you take advantage of the skiing opportunities in Banff? Sounds like it would have been a lot of fun!\\nEvan: [Evan shared an image: a photo of a group of people skiing down a snow covered slope] Yeah, it was great for skiing! The snow was amazing and I had a lot of fun. Can\'t wait to go back next year! Did you try any winter sports, Sam?"\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 84,\n    "timestamp": "August 19, 2023(Saturday) at 06:31 PM",\n    "messages": "Sam: Ooh, skiing looks like a blast! I\'d love to try it but I\'m not sure my body can take it. What about you? What winter activities do you enjoy?\\nEvan: Skiing, snowboarding, and ice skating are all fun winter activities I enjoy."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 85,\n    "timestamp": "August 19, 2023(Saturday) at 06:32 PM",\n    "messages": "Sam: Wish I could join in on the fun! It sounds awesome.\\nEvan: I\'d like you to join me, too. Winter activities are a blast - hopefully someday you will!\\nSam: Yeah, maybe. It\'s hard with that, you know. But who knows? Thanks for the understanding, Evan - it really means a lot."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 86,\n    "timestamp": "August 27, 2023(Sunday) at 10:18 AM",\n    "messages": "Sam: Hey Evan! Exciting news: I started a new diet and exercise routine last Monday and it\'s made a huge difference. I feel great! What about you, what changes have you made recently?\\nEvan: Wow, Sam, great! Glad your new diet/exercise is going well. As for me, I\'ve hit a sore spot lately. Twisted my knee last Friday and it\'s really painful, so it\'s been tough to stay consistent with my usual fitness routine. It\'s really frustrating because staying active is like, mega-important to me."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 87,\n    "timestamp": "August 27, 2023(Sunday) at 10:19 AM",\n    "messages": "Sam: Oh no, sorry to hear about that, Evan. It\'s frustrating when our bodies don\'t cooperate, isn\'t it? Is there anything I can do to help?\\nEvan: Thanks, Sam. I appreciate the concern. Life throws us curveballs - that\'s life, right? By the way, remember that book I was talking about? It just gets better with every page, can\'t let it out of my hands!"\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 88,\n    "timestamp": "August 27, 2023(Sunday) at 10:20 AM",\n    "messages": "Sam: Life sure can be unpredictable and tough. Being adaptable and finding other ways to stay active is key when you\'re facing an obstacle. Maybe look into low-impact exercises or physical therapy to help with that? And damn, you really got me interested in this book haha!\\nEvan: Yeah, PT for my knee is on the cards. Hopefully I\'ll get an appointment soon. Till then, just keeping it low-key and swimming to stay active.\\nSam: Swimming is a good choice, Evan. It\'s low-impact and easy on the joints, plus it\'s refreshing. Keep up with the active lifestyle!"\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 89,\n    "timestamp": "August 27, 2023(Sunday) at 10:21 AM",\n    "messages": "Evan: [Evan shared an image: a photography of a car is parked near a lake with mountains in the background] Yeah, thanks for the push, Sam. Oh, hey, I came across this pic when I was tidying up. I took a road trip last month - the scenery was stunning and nature really chilled me out.\\nSam: Wow, looks great! Where did you go? Bet it was nice to get away.\\nEvan: Thanks! I went up to the Rocky Mountains, it was so refreshing! The views were stunning and I felt so relaxed. Do you enjoy road trips and exploring nature?"\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 90,\n    "timestamp": "August 27, 2023(Sunday) at 10:23 AM",\n    "messages": "Sam: I haven\'t gone on a road trip in ages, but I love being surrounded by nature. It\'s so tranquil and refreshing. I\'d love to go hiking more, but it can be a bit challenging sometimes. However, I am working on becoming healthier, so maybe a road trip and a hike will be possible soon.\\nEvan: [Evan shared an image: a photo of a lake with a mountain in the background] That\'s cool, Sam. Nature can be really peaceful. I\'d suggest going for more hikes, like I do. It\'s always been calming and fun. We should definitely do one together sometime."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 91,\n    "timestamp": "August 27, 2023(Sunday) at 10:24 AM",\n    "messages": "Sam: Sounds like fun! Which lake do you recommend? I\'d love to explore some of the local trails.\\nEvan: [Evan shared an image: a photo of a lake with a mountain in the background] Check out this one! It\'s gorgeous and there are lots of trails nearby. You\'ll love it!\\nSam: Wow, it looks great! Is it nearby? What a view!\\nEvan: It\'s only a two-hour drive from here, but trust me, it\'s worth every minute for the incredible views and peaceful atmosphere.\\nSam: Cool, a day trip\'s doable. Nature\'s calling me, so I\'m gonna go check it out! Thanks!"\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 92,\n    "timestamp": "August 27, 2023(Sunday) at 10:26 AM",\n    "messages": "Evan: No worries, enjoy your time in nature. Take care! Bye!\\nSam: Thanks Evan. Have a good one. See ya!"\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 93,\n    "timestamp": "September 11, 2023(Monday) at 09:28 AM",\n    "messages": "Evan: [Evan shared an image: a photo of a painting of a sunset over a body of water] Hey Sam! Long time no talk! Hope all is good. What have I been doing these past few weeks?"\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 94,\n    "timestamp": "September 11, 2023(Monday) at 09:28 AM",\n    "messages": "Sam: [Sam shared an image: a photo of a bowl of beef and vegetables with a package of healthy choice] Hey Evan! Nice to hear from you. Life has been an up and down ride."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 95,\n    "timestamp": "September 11, 2023(Monday) at 09:28 AM",\n    "messages": "Sam: Have you seen the pic I posted of my before and after body as a result of the diet? Working to motivate others to make better choices.\\nEvan: Hey Sam! Loving it. Making healthier choices has definitely made a difference for me. It\'s amazing how small changes can have such a big impact. How about you? Is it making a difference for you too?"\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 96,\n    "timestamp": "September 11, 2023(Monday) at 09:29 AM",\n    "messages": "Sam: Hey Evan, thanks for the support! Handling all this has 