es photo and asked when Evan\'s family had visited. Evan replied that they had hiked the trails last week (May 11, 2023), emphasizing the amazing views they experienced during their outdoor adventure."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 4,\n    "timestamp": "May 18, 2023(Thursday) at 01:50 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 1:50 PM on May 18, 2023 (Thursday), Sam shared a photograph showing a man and a child walking through a forest. Sam reflected on a personal hiking memory from childhood, recalling a hike with his father when he was ten years old. Sam described the experience as great fun and a really special bonding moment."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 5,\n    "timestamp": "May 18, 2023(Thursday) at 01:50 PM",\n    "narrative": "Also at 1:50 PM on May 18, 2023 (Thursday), Evan responded to Sam\'s hiking story by asking how far they had hiked during that childhood outing. Sam answered that they had covered a good distance, which was quite an achievement for him at that age, and noted that it remained a great memory."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 6,\n    "timestamp": "May 18, 2023(Thursday) at 01:51 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 1:51 PM on May 18, 2023 (Thursday), Evan shifted the conversation by asking Sam what other hobbies he had discovered for himself, showing interest in Sam\'s current personal interests."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 7,\n    "timestamp": "May 18, 2023(Thursday) at 01:52 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 1:52 PM on May 18, 2023 (Thursday), Sam shared a photo of a person holding a paint set in a store and mentioned that he had not yet found a hobby but was thinking about trying painting. Sam asked Evan if he had any hobbies he loved, indicating openness to exploring creative activities."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 8,\n    "timestamp": "May 18, 2023(Thursday) at 01:52 PM",\n    "narrative": "Also at 1:52 PM on May 18, 2023 (Thursday), Evan responded positively to Sam\'s idea of painting, calling it a cool idea and asking if Sam had tried painting before, showing encouragement and curiosity about Sam\'s experience."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 9,\n    "timestamp": "May 18, 2023(Thursday) at 01:53 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 1:53 PM on May 18, 2023 (Thursday), Sam admitted he had not yet tried painting but was keen to give it a go. Sam described painting as a nice way to relax and be creative, indicating motivation to start this new hobby."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 10,\n    "timestamp": "May 18, 2023(Thursday) at 01:53 PM",\n    "narrative": "Also at 1:53 PM on May 18, 2023 (Thursday), Evan shared a photo of a watercolor painting depicting a cactus in the desert. He explained that painting was a great stress-buster for him and that he had started doing watercolor painting a few years ago."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 11,\n    "timestamp": "May 18, 2023(Thursday) at 01:54 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 1:54 PM on May 18, 2023 (Thursday), Sam expressed admiration for Evan\'s painting skills and asked how Evan got into watercolor painting. Evan explained that a friend introduced him to the hobby and gave him advice, which led to him becoming hooked immediately."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 12,\n    "timestamp": "May 18, 2023(Thursday) at 01:55 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 1:55 PM on May 18, 2023 (Thursday), Sam expressed hope that he could find a hobby he was as passionate about as Evan was with watercolor painting, showing inspiration from Evan\'s enthusiasm."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 13,\n    "timestamp": "May 18, 2023(Thursday) at 01:55 PM",\n    "narrative": "Also at 1:55 PM on May 18, 2023 (Thursday), Evan encouraged Sam by saying that he would find a hobby he loved by continuing to try new things until something sparked his excitement."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 14,\n    "timestamp": "May 18, 2023(Thursday) at 01:56 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 1:56 PM on May 18, 2023 (Thursday), Sam thanked Evan and expressed excitement about trying new hobbies, anticipating fun experiences. Evan reciprocated enthusiasm and suggested they catch up soon to discuss how Sam was enjoying his new hobbies. Sam agreed to keep Evan posted, and they exchanged friendly goodbyes, looking forward to their next meeting."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 15,\n    "timestamp": "May 24, 2023(Wednesday) at 07:11 PM",\n    "narrative": "On May 24, 2023 (Wednesday) at 7:11 PM, Evan reached out to Sam, sharing that since their last conversation, much had happened. Evan described a recent family road trip to Jasper the previous weekend (May 20-21, 2023), highlighting the drive along the Icefields Parkway and the stunning glaciers and lakes they saw. Evan shared a photo of a glacier taken during the trip. Sam responded with enthusiasm, noting that he had never been to Jasper but found the scenery breathtaking, and asked Evan for more details about the road trip and whether it was relaxing. Evan replied that the trip was great, emphasizing the fresh air, peacefulness, and a cozy cabin surrounded by mountains and forests that made the trip feel like a true retreat."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 16,\n    "timestamp": "May 24, 2023(Wednesday) at 07:12 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 7:12 PM on May 24, 2023 (Wednesday), Sam acknowledged Evan\'s description of the peaceful trip and reflected on the importance of taking time for oneself, especially after a hard week. Sam revealed that his own week had been tough. Evan expressed sympathy and offered help. Sam appreciated the offer but explained that he had recently had a doctor\'s check-up a few days prior (around May 21, 2023), which revealed concerning weight results, describing the experience as eye-opening."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 17,\n    "timestamp": "May 24, 2023(Wednesday) at 07:14 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 7:14 PM on May 24, 2023 (Wednesday), Evan acknowledged the challenge Sam faced confronting his health issues and reminded Sam that it was never too late to make positive lifestyle changes. Evan offered support for Sam\'s journey toward better health. Sam thanked Evan and asked for tips on how to start breaking old habits."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 18,\n    "timestamp": "May 24, 2023(Wednesday) at 07:15 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 7:15 PM on May 24, 2023 (Wednesday), Evan shared that what worked for him was finding a fitness routine he genuinely enjoyed, which became his go-to activity. He loved the feeling of being healthy and strong. Evan emphasized making exercise fun and incorporating small smarter dietary choices that added up over time. He encouraged Sam by affirming that Sam had the capability to succeed."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 19,\n    "timestamp": "May 24, 2023(Wednesday) at 07:15 PM",\n    "narrative": "Also at 7:15 PM on May 24, 2023 (Wednesday), Sam mentioned that he had been looking for a hobby to stay motivated and was thinking about trying painting. Sam asked Evan if painting would help him de-stress. Evan affirmed that painting was a great way to relieve stress and be creative, allowing freedom to explore colors, textures, and express feelings. Evan shared that he had been painting for a few years and found it peaceful. However, Evan clarified that painting alone would not address Sam\'s weight concerns and recommended exercise as an additional necessary component."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 20,\n    "timestamp": "May 24, 2023(Wednesday) at 07:16 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 7:16 PM on May 24, 2023 (Wednesday), Sam thanked Evan for the encouragement and committed to trying painting, promising to update Evan on how it went. Evan responded enthusiastically, advising Sam to have fun and not put too much pressure on himself. Sam agreed to enjoy the process without stress. Evan encouraged Sam to keep him updated, and Sam promised to do so before they exchanged goodbyes."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 21,\n    "timestamp": "June 06, 2023(Tuesday) at 03:55 PM",\n    "narrative": "On June 6, 2023 (Tuesday) at 3:55 PM, Evan reached out to Sam after a period of no contact, sharing that life had been a rollercoaster lately. Evan disclosed a recent health scare involving a sudden heart palpitation incident the previous week (around May 30, 2023), which served as a serious wake-up call about his lifestyle. Sam responded with a photo of a plate of vegetables and a glass of milk, expressing gladness that Evan was feeling better."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 22,\n    "timestamp": "June 06, 2023(Tuesday) at 03:55 PM",\n    "narrative": "Also at 3:55 PM on June 6, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam mentioned that he was trying to eat healthier these days. Evan complimented the salad Sam shared and explained that he was being extra careful with his health, trying to reduce processed foods and sugary snacks despite his fondness for ginger snaps. Evan asked Sam if he had made any recent dietary changes."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 23,\n    "timestamp": "June 06, 2023(Tuesday) at 03:56 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 3:56 PM on June 6, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam admitted that he had not made any changes to his diet and was still enjoying soda and candy, though he acknowledged these were not good habits. Evan empathized with the difficulty of breaking habits and suggested small changes that could have a big impact over time. He recommended swapping soda for flavored seltzer water to maintain a bubbly, tasty drink without sugar and replacing candy with dark chocolate with high cocoa content as a healthier option. Evan asked Sam what he thought of these suggestions."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 24,\n    "timestamp": "June 06, 2023(Tuesday) at 03:57 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 3:57 PM on June 6, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam agreed that Evan\'s ideas were good and said he would give them a try. Evan encouraged Sam to keep him informed about how it went, emphasizing that small changes could significantly improve health and that every step mattered. Sam thanked Evan and promised to keep him posted. Evan expressed his commitment to supporting Sam on their respective health journeys, reminding Sam that progress takes time. Sam acknowledged this and expressed readiness to keep trying and making small changes. Evan motivated Sam to keep up the effort, assuring him that every bit counted and that he would reach his goals. Sam appreciated Evan\'s support, stating it meant a lot to have Evan in his corner."\n  }\n]\n\n---\n\n### EXTRACTION RULES\n\n#### 1. Atomicity\n* Each entry in `"atomic_fact"` must express **exactly one coherent unit of meaning** — an action, emotion, reason, plan, decision, or statement.\n* If a speaker expresses multiple ideas (e.g., an event and its reason), split them into multiple atomic facts.\n* Each atomic_fact must be **independent and retrievable on its own**.\n\n#### 2. Time & Date Handling\n* Do **not** add or prepend timestamps such as "On March 10, 2024" to each fact.\n* The `"time"` field already represents the episode\'s start time.\n* However, when the original text mentions **explicit or relative time expressions**, you must:\n  - **Preserve** explicit dates verbatim (e.g., "October 6, 2023").\n  - **Resolve** relative or vague times (e.g., "yesterday", "last week", "two months ago") relative to the timestamp, and **append the resolved absolute date in parentheses**.\n    Example: "Gina said she launched the campaign yesterday (March 9, 2024)."\n  - If the exact resolution is uncertain, use a normalized vague phrase (e.g., "in early 2023", "during the summer of 2021") instead of guessing.\n\n#### 3. Content Preservation\n* Preserve **all semantically meaningful information**, including:\n  - emotions, attitudes, reasons, intentions, consequences, conditions, and comparisons\n* Resolve pronouns into explicit names or entities when unambiguous.\n* Keep original wording as much as possible — only fix grammar for clarity.\n\n#### 4. Expression Format\n* Write each atomic_fact as a **single, complete English sentence** in **third-person** form.\n  - e.g., "Gina said that she had launched an ad campaign for her clothing store yesterday (March 9, 2024)."\n* Do **not** simplify, paraphrase, or merge logically distinct ideas.\n\n#### 5. Retrieval Clarity\n* Each atomic_fact must be concise, factual, and self-contained.\n* Avoid small talk or filler unless it conveys meaningful emotional or informational content.\n* Ensure entities and actions are explicit and unambiguous.\n\n---\n\n### QUALITY CHECKS\nBefore returning the final output, verify that:\n1. Every meaningful fact, intention, and emotion is included.\n2. Each `atomic_fact` contains exactly one idea.\n3. All relevant time references are preserved or normalized.\n4. Wording remains faithful to the source.\n5. The output JSON is valid and follows the exact schema.\n\n---\n\n### Output Format (BATCH)\nReturn a JSON object with results for ALL narratives:\n{\n    "results": [\n        {\n            "unit_id": 0,\n            "time": "May 08, 2023(Monday) at 01:56 PM",\n            "atomic_fact": [\n                "Tom asked Sarah about her weekend plans.",\n                "Sarah mentioned she went hiking at Mount Wilson.",\n                "..."\n            ]\n        },\n        {\n            "unit_id": 1,\n            "time": "...",\n            "atomic_fact": ["...", "..."]\n        }\n    ]\n}\n\n**Critical Rules:**\n- Process ALL narratives in order (unit_id must match input)\n- Do NOT skip any unit\n- Ensure valid JSON output\n\nReturn only the JSON object:\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-4.1-mini', 'max_tokens': 32768, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}, 'temperature': 0}}
