p. It\'s been helping me move forward to healthier habits!\'"\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 62,\n    "timestamp": "August 13, 2023(Sunday) at 04:13 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 4:13 PM on August 13, 2023 (Sunday), Evan expressed love for the quote and said the mindset helped him too, thanking Sam. Sam responded that he was glad it helped and acknowledged that these times could be challenging."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 63,\n    "timestamp": "August 13, 2023(Sunday) at 04:14 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 4:14 PM on August 13, 2023 (Sunday), Evan reminded Sam to celebrate small wins because every step forward counts. Sam agreed wholeheartedly, emphasizing that celebrating small victories is crucial since it is easy to get caught up in challenges and setbacks. Sam thanked Evan for the reminder, saying it was much appreciated."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 64,\n    "timestamp": "August 13, 2023(Sunday) at 04:15 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 4:15 PM on August 13, 2023 (Sunday), Evan encouraged Sam to keep up the good work, cheering for him. Evan then humorously shared that he had been searching for his keys for the last half hour with no luck and joked about losing it every week."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 65,\n    "timestamp": "August 13, 2023(Sunday) at 04:15 PM",\n    "narrative": "Also at 4:15 PM on August 13, 2023 (Sunday), Sam promised to be Evan\'s cheerleader once he got some sleep. Sam then shared an amazing dream he had the previous night where he was soaring over skyscrapers, describing the feeling as incredible and wondering about its significance."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 66,\n    "timestamp": "August 13, 2023(Sunday) at 04:16 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 4:16 PM on August 13, 2023 (Sunday), Evan responded that Sam\'s dream sounded amazing and suggested checking out a dream interpretation book for insights. Evan wished Sam sweet dreams."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 67,\n    "timestamp": "August 13, 2023(Sunday) at 04:16 PM",\n    "narrative": "Also at 4:16 PM on August