ater, explaining that this little island was where he grew up and that it was his happy place. Sam expressed admiration for the spot, noting how peaceful and stunning it must have been to grow up there. This exchange deepened the personal connection by sharing meaningful places from Evan’s past."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 187,\n    "timestamp": "November 21, 2023(Tuesday) at 07:39 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 7:39 PM on November 21, 2023 (Tuesday), Evan affirmed that growing up on the island had shaped him and that it would always hold a special place in his heart. Sam agreed, describing such places as soul-calming. This conversation emphasized the emotional and formative significance of Evan’s childhood environment."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 188,\n    "timestamp": "November 21, 2023(Tuesday) at 07:40 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 7:40 PM on November 21, 2023 (Tuesday), Evan shared a photograph of a person walking on a beach at sunset, reinforcing the serene and calming nature of the island. Sam responded by calling the scene \'heavenly,\' highlighting the peacefulness and beauty of the location. This exchange further illustrated the tranquil atmosphere of Evan’s cherished place."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 189,\n    "timestamp": "November 21, 2023(Tuesday) at 07:41 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 7:41 PM on November 21, 2023 (Tuesday), Evan shared an image of a sunset over a body of water, describing the island as a little slice of paradise where he always felt peaceful and serene. Sam expressed gratitude for Evan sharing this glimpse into his peaceful retreat, acknowledging its calming qualities. This moment reinforced the theme of tranquility associated with Evan’s childhood home."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 190,\n    "timestamp": "November 21, 2023(Tuesday) at 07:42 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 7:42 PM on November 21, 2023 (Tuesday), Evan concluded the conversation by saying it was always good to chat about tranquil times and wished Sam to take it easy. Sam reciprocated by telling Evan to take care and to hang in there. Evan thanked Sam and reassured him that he was available to talk whenever needed. This exchange ended the evening on a supportive and caring note."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 191,\n    "timestamp": "December 05, 2023(Tuesday) at 08:16 PM",\n    "narrative": "On December 5, 2023 (Tuesday) at 8:16 PM, Evan reached out to Sam to share some frustrating news: his newly purchased Prius had broken down. Evan explained that this was a significant stressor because he relied on the car for his active lifestyle and road trips. He expressed frustration that something new could malfunction so soon. Sam responded empathetically, acknowledging how difficult it is to deal with a new car breaking down, especially when it is the primary mode of transportation."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 192,\n    "timestamp": "December 05, 2023(Tuesday) at 08:17 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 8:17 PM on December 5, 2023 (Tuesday), Evan elaborated that he had been counting on the new Prius to be reliable, and dealing with unexpected issues was challenging. He accepted that even new cars can have problems. Sam offered a positive perspective, suggesting that setbacks like this can sometimes lead to new opportunities. Evan agreed and expressed that he was trying to view the situation as a chance to explore alternative ways to stay active and travel, possibly trying something different."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 193,\n    "timestamp": "December 05, 2023(Tuesday) at 08:18 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 8:18 PM on December 5, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam shared an image showing a variety of bowls filled with fruit and yogurt. Sam related this to his recent attendance at a Weight Watchers meeting the day before (December 4, 2023), where he had learned valuable tips. This indicated Sam’s ongoing efforts to improve his diet and health."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 194,\n    "timestamp": "December 05, 2023(Tuesday) at 08:19 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 8:19 PM on December 5, 2023 (Tuesday), Evan complimented the smoothie bowl Sam had shared and asked how the Weight Watchers meeting had gone. Evan also mentioned that he had been considering trying yoga as a gentle yet effective way to relieve stress and improve flexibility. He asked Sam for his opinion on yoga, seeking advice based on Sam’s experience."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 195,\n    "timestamp": "December 05, 2023(Tuesday) at 08:19 PM",\n    "narrative": "Also at 8:19 PM on December 5, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam responded that the Weight Watchers meeting had been insightful and that the smoothie bowl was well received. Sam strongly recommended yoga, sharing that it had greatly improved his flexibility and reduced his stress levels. He encouraged Evan to try it and offered to provide yoga tips or other support if needed. Evan expressed gratitude and confirmed he would try yoga, appreciating Sam’s suggestion."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 196,\n    "timestamp": "December 05, 2023(Tuesday) at 08:21 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 8:21 PM on December 5, 2023 (Tuesday), Evan expressed that Sam’s support had been invaluable during his attempts to try new things like yoga. Sam replied that everyone needs help when starting new activities and that having support is important. Evan agreed, noting that knowing he was not alone made a big difference. Sam encouraged Evan to keep him updated on how yoga went and said goodbye. Evan reciprocated the farewell, thanking Sam and promising to talk soon. This exchange highlighted their ongoing mutual encouragement and friendship."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 197,\n    "timestamp": "December 09, 2023(Saturday) at 01:45 PM",\n    "narrative": "On December 9, 2023 (Saturday) at 1:45 PM, Evan contacted Sam to share wonderful news: his partner was pregnant. Evan expressed excitement about the upcoming addition to their family, noting it had been a while since they had a child around. Sam congratulated Evan warmly and remarked on how amazing parenthood is, celebrating the joyful news."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 198,\n    "timestamp": "December 09, 2023(Saturday) at 01:45 PM",\n    "narrative": "Also at 1:45 PM on December 9, 2023 (Saturday), Sam asked Evan how he was feeling about the pregnancy. Evan admitted feeling both excited and a bit nervous, acknowledging it had been some time since he had a toddler in the house. He looked forward to the rewarding experience of parenthood and reminisced about the joy he felt when his first child was born. Evan anticipated witnessing the miracle of life again and building new family memories. Sam responded by affirming that Evan would be an amazing parent and encouraged him to treasure those special memories."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 199,\n    "timestamp": "December 09, 2023(Saturday) at 01:47 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 1:47 PM on December 9, 2023 (Saturday), Evan shared an image of a desk featuring a lamp, a picture frame, and a sign. He explained that the image was a collage of some of their top family memories, including photos from birthdays, holidays, and vacations. Evan expressed how meaningful it was to look back and recall all the great times they had shared. Sam responded warmly, complimenting Evan’s family and noting how happy they appeared in the photos. This exchange highlighted Evan’s appreciation for family history and joyful moments."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 200,\n    "timestamp": "December 09, 2023(Saturday) at 01:47 PM",\n    "narrative": "On December 9, 2023 (Saturday) at 1:47 PM, Sam asked Evan about the story behind a sign displayed in the center of a frame. Evan explained that the sign originated from their family trip to Banff and bears the phrase \'Bring it on Home,\' which serves as their family\'s motto. This motto constantly reminds them of the importance of togetherness regardless of their location. Sam found this explanation touching and acknowledged the significance of having a symbol that strengthens family bonds."\n  }\n]\n\n---\n\n### EXTRACTION RULES\n\n#### 1. Atomicity\n* Each entry in `"atomic_fact"` must express **exactly one coherent unit of meaning** — an action, emotion, reason, plan, decision, or statement.\n* If a speaker expresses multiple ideas (e.g., an event and its reason), split them into multiple atomic facts.\n* Each atomic_fact must be **independent and retrievable on its own**.\n\n#### 2. Time & Date Handling\n* Do **not** add or prepend timestamps such as "On March 10, 2024" to each fact.\n* The `"time"` field already represents the episode\'s start time.\n* However, when the original text mentions **explicit or relative time expressions**, you must:\n  - **Preserve** explicit dates verbatim (e.g., "October 6, 2023").\n  - **Resolve** relative or vague times (e.g., "yesterday", "last week", "two months ago") relative to the timestamp, and **append the resolved absolute date in parentheses**.\n    Example: "Gina said she launched the campaign yesterday (March 9, 2024)."\n  - If the exact resolution is uncertain, use a normalized vague phrase (e.g., "in early 2023", "during the summer of 2021") instead of guessing.\n\n#### 3. Content Preservation\n* Preserve **all semantically meaningful information**, including:\n  - emotions, attitudes, reasons, intentions, consequences, conditions, and comparisons\n* Resolve pronouns into explicit names or entities when unambiguous.\n* Keep original wording as much as possible — only fix grammar for clarity.\n\n#### 4. Expression Format\n* Write each atomic_fact as a **single, complete English sentence** in **third-person** form.\n  - e.g., "Gina said that she had launched an ad campaign for her clothing store yesterday (March 9, 2024)."\n* Do **not** simplify, paraphrase, or merge logically distinct ideas.\n\n#### 5. Retrieval Clarity\n* Each atomic_fact must be concise, factual, and self-contained.\n* Avoid small talk or filler unless it conveys meaningful emotional or informational content.\n* Ensure entities and actions are explicit and unambiguous.\n\n---\n\n### QUALITY CHECKS\nBefore returning the final output, verify that:\n1. Every meaningful fact, intention, and emotion is included.\n2. Each `atomic_fact` contains exactly one idea.\n3. All relevant time references are preserved or normalized.\n4. Wording remains faithful to the source.\n5. The output JSON is valid and follows the exact schema.\n\n---\n\n### Output Format (BATCH)\nReturn a JSON object with results for ALL narratives:\n{\n    "results": [\n        {\n            "unit_id": 0,\n            "time": "May 08, 2023(Monday) at 01:56 PM",\n            "atomic_fact": [\n                "Tom asked Sarah about her weekend plans.",\n                "Sarah mentioned she went hiking at Mount Wilson.",\n                "..."\n            ]\n        },\n        {\n            "unit_id": 1,\n            "time": "...",\n            "atomic_fact": ["...", "..."]\n        }\n    ]\n}\n\n**Critical Rules:**\n- Process ALL narratives in order (unit_id must match input)\n- Do NOT skip any unit\n- Ensure valid JSON output\n\nReturn only the JSON object:\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-4.1-mini', 'max_tokens': 32768, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}, 'temperature': 0}}
