union and Evan reiterating his gratitude for Sam’s kind words and encouragement."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 204,\n    "timestamp": "December 17, 2023(Sunday) at 06:48 PM",\n    "narrative": "On December 17, 2023 (Sunday) at 6:48 PM, Evan reached out to Sam, greeting him and noting it had been a long time since they last spoke. Evan mentioned that a lot had happened recently. Sam responded that he was doing okay but had experienced some difficulties or \'bumps\' in life."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 205,\n    "timestamp": "December 17, 2023(Sunday) at 06:48 PM",\n    "narrative": "Continuing at 6:48 PM on December 17, 2023 (Sunday), Sam asked Evan how he was doing. Evan shared a photo of a young boy with crutches and a backpack, explaining that his son had an accident last Tuesday (December 12, 2023), falling off his bike and enduring a rough time. Evan reassured Sam that his son was doing better now."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 206,\n    "timestamp": "December 17, 2023(Sunday) at 06:49 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 6:49 PM on December 17, 2023 (Sunday), Evan asked Sam how he was coping with his own challenges. Sam expressed sympathy for Evan’s son’s accident and hoped for his continued recovery. Sam also shared that he had been going through a tough time himself recently."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 207,\n    "timestamp": "December 17, 2023(Sunday) at 06:49 PM",\n    "narrative": "Also at 6:49 PM on December 17, 2023 (Sunday), Sam revealed that after their conversation, he had been thinking about ways to cope with his difficulties but found it challenging to do so."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 208,\n    "timestamp": "December 17, 2023(Sunday) at 06:50 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 6:50 PM on December 17, 2023 (Sunday), Evan acknowledged that life can be hard sometimes and asked Sam if he had any hobbies or activities that made him happy. Sam responded that he used to love hiking but had not had the chance to go hiking in a while."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 209,\n    "timestamp": "December 17, 2023(Sunday) at 06:51 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 6:51 PM on December 17, 2023 (Sunday), Evan recalled that Sam had mentioned his love for hiking before. He emphasized that hiking is a great way to center oneself and connect with nature. Evan proposed that they should definitely plan a hike together soon."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 210,\n    "timestamp": "December 17, 2023(Sunday) at 06:51 PM",\n    "narrative": "Also at 6:51 PM on December 17, 2023 (Sunday), Sam confided in Evan that he was struggling with his weight, which was negatively affecting his confidence. He expressed feelings of lacking motivation and difficulty overcoming the challenges related to his weight."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 211,\n    "timestamp": "December 17, 2023(Sunday) at 06:52 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 6:52 PM on December 17, 2023 (Sunday), Evan empathized with Sam’s challenges and encouraged him to believe in himself and take progress one day at a time. Evan reminded Sam that his worth is not defined by his weight. Sam appreciated Evan’s support and admitted that breaking out of his comfort zone was tough."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 212,\n    "timestamp": "December 17, 2023(Sunday) at 06:53 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 6:53 PM on December 17, 2023 (Sunday), Evan acknowledged that stepping out of one’s comfort zone can be intimidating but reassured Sam that it is worthwhile. Evan advised Sam to challenge himself to try something new, even if it is a small step. Sam thanked Evan and agreed to take his advice, though he noted that trying new things can be difficult."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 213,\n    "timestamp": "December 17, 2023(Sunday) at 06:54 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 6:54 PM on December 17, 2023 (Sunday), Evan shared a photo of a woman standing in front of a painting. He explained that trying something new and succeeding brings a great feeling of accomplishment. Evan encouraged Sam to give it a try, even if it is just a small effort, assuring him that he would be amazed by the results."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 214,\n    "timestamp": "December 17, 2023(Sunday) at 06:54 PM",\n    "narrative": "Also at 6:54 PM on December 17, 2023 (Sunday), Sam commented that the woman in the photo looked very confident and asked about the kind of painting in the background. Evan described the painting as a contemporary figurative piece he had finished a few days prior. The painting emphasizes emotional states through expressive brushwork and vibrant colors, capturing a moment of introspection where the subject is deeply immersed in thought. Evan expressed pride in this work."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 215,\n    "timestamp": "December 17, 2023(Sunday) at 06:55 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 6:55 PM on December 17, 2023 (Sunday), Sam complimented Evan’s painting and asked who the girl standing next to it was. Evan explained that she was a close friend who had helped him get the painting published in an exhibition."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 216,\n    "timestamp": "December 26, 2023(Tuesday) at 04:25 PM",\n    "narrative": "On December 26, 2023 (Tuesday) at 4:25 PM, Sam greeted Evan, noting it had been a long time since they last connected and asked how he was doing. Evan responded by sharing a photograph of a bride and groom kissing in front of a tree, revealing that he had gotten married the previous week (around December 19, 2023). Evan admitted that life had been up and down lately and asked Sam how he was doing."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 217,\n    "timestamp": "December 26, 2023(Tuesday) at 04:26 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 4:26 PM on December 26, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam congratulated Evan on his recent marriage and asked if the woman in the photo was the one from Canada. Evan confirmed that she was and expressed surprise that they had not married earlier, explaining that he had been in love with her at first sight."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 218,\n    "timestamp": "December 26, 2023(Tuesday) at 04:27 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 4:27 PM on December 26, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam reacted to Evan’s story of love at first sight, describing it as something out of a fairy tale. Sam asked Evan if he believed in love at first sight. Evan affirmed his belief, describing the experience as if time had stopped and a spark had ignited inside him, making it feel completely right. Sam expressed enthusiasm, acknowledging how liberating it must feel to find such a connection and reflecting on the powerful nature of love."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 219,\n    "timestamp": "December 26, 2023(Tuesday) at 04:28 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 4:28 PM on December 26, 2023 (Tuesday), Evan shared a photo of a person sitting on a rock near the water and reflected on how love brings immense happiness and fulfillment. He likened love to a beautiful sunset that lights up life and brings peace, describing it as an incredible experience."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 220,\n    "timestamp": "December 26, 2023(Tuesday) at 04:29 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 4:29 PM on December 26, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam admitted that he had not experienced love in the same way but had started enjoying running in the mornings as a way to clear his head. Evan responded by sharing a photo of a painting with a white background featuring blue, orange, and black colors. He acknowledged Sam’s approach to life, emphasizing the importance of finding what works for oneself. Evan encouraged Sam to keep trying new things, suggesting that he might find his own version of love in unexpected places and urged him to embrace the journey, which is full of surprises."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 221,\n    "timestamp": "December 26, 2023(Tuesday) at 04:30 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 4:30 PM on December 26, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam admired the minimalistic and stunning nature of Evan’s painting and wondered about the inspiration behind it. Evan revealed that he had created the painting during a time when he was experiencing a mix of emotions including sadness, anger, and hopefulness. He reflected on how art can portray feelings without words. Sam expressed fascination with how art can express emotions so effectively."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 222,\n    "timestamp": "December 26, 2023(Tuesday) at 04:31 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 4:31 PM on December 26, 2023 (Tuesday), Evan shared a photo of another painting featuring a bird flying over it. He described how art helps him recognize and manage his own feelings. Evan explained that this particular painting gave him a massive rush of joy."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 223,\n    "timestamp": "December 26, 2023(Tuesday) at 04:32 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 4:32 PM on December 26, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam asked Evan about the emotions that inspired the painting he had shared. Evan explained that he painted it with a sense of joy and freedom. He described the spontaneous brush strokes and bold colors as reflecting a playful and liberated mood, embracing the creative process without restraint."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 224,\n    "timestamp": "December 26, 2023(Tuesday) at 04:33 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 4:33 PM on December 26, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam shared a photo of a woman holding flowers in front of her face, describing it as amazing and praising Evan’s serious talent and creativity. Sam noted that creating such a painting must have been very satisfying. Evan thanked Sam for the compliment and commented that the painting Sam shared had an inspiring vibe. Evan then asked Sam how long he had been painting."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 225,\n    "timestamp": "December 26, 2023(Tuesday) at 04:34 PM",\n    "narrative": "On December 26, 2023 (Tuesday) at 4:34 PM, Sam shared with Evan that he occasionally sketches but had not yet created anything remarkable. Sam expressed optimism that he would soon have something to show off and found Evan\'s passion for sketching inspiring. Evan appreciated Sam\'s encouragement and offered to help him get started whenever he wanted. During this exchange, Evan also mentioned that he had lost his keys again, noting that it had become a weekly ritual for him to misplace them."\n  }\n]\n\n---\n\n### EXTRACTION RULES\n\n#### 1. Atomicity\n* Each entry in `"atomic_fact"` must express **exactly one coherent unit of meaning** — an action, emotion, reason, plan, decision, or statement.\n* If a speaker expresses multiple ideas (e.g., an event and its reason), split them into multiple atomic facts.\n* Each atomic_fact must be **independent and retrievable on its own**.\n\n#### 2. Time & Date Handling\n* Do **not** add or prepend timestamps such as "On March 10, 2024" to each fact.\n* The `"time"` field already represents the episode\'s start time.\n* However, when the original text mentions **explicit or relative time expressions**, you must:\n  - **Preserve** explicit dates verbatim (e.g., "October 6, 2023").\n  - **Resolve** relative or vague times (e.g., "yesterday", "last week", "two months ago") relative to the timestamp, and **append the resolved absolute date in parentheses**.\n    Example: "Gina said she launched the campaign yesterday (March 9, 2024)."\n  - If the exact resolution is uncertain, use a normalized vague phrase (e.g., "in early 2023", "during the summer of 2021") instead of guessing.\n\n#### 3. Content Preservation\n* Preserve **all semantically meaningful information**, including:\n  - emotions, attitudes, reasons, intentions, consequences, conditions, and comparisons\n* Resolve pronouns into explicit names or entities when unambiguous.\n* Keep original wording as much as possible — only fix grammar for clarity.\n\n#### 4. Expression Format\n* Write each atomic_fact as a **single, complete English sentence** in **third-person** form.\n  - e.g., "Gina said that she had launched an ad campaign for her clothing store yesterday (March 9, 2024)."\n* Do **not** simplify, paraphrase, or merge logically distinct ideas.\n\n#### 5. Retrieval Clarity\n* Each atomic_fact must be concise, factual, and self-contained.\n* Avoid small talk or filler unless it conveys meaningful emotional or informational content.\n* Ensure entities and actions are explicit and unambiguous.\n\n---\n\n### QUALITY CHECKS\nBefore returning the final output, verify that:\n1. Every meaningful fact, intention, and emotion is included.\n2. Each `atomic_fact` contains exactly one idea.\n3. All relevant time references are preserved or normalized.\n4. Wording remains faithful to the source.\n5. The output JSON is valid and follows the exact schema.\n\n---\n\n### Output Format (BATCH)\nReturn a JSON object with results for ALL narratives:\n{\n    "results": [\n        {\n            "unit_id": 0,\n            "time": "May 08, 2023(Monday) at 01:56 PM",\n            "atomic_fact": [\n                "Tom asked Sarah about her weekend plans.",\n                "Sarah mentioned she went hiking at Mount Wilson.",\n                "..."\n            ]\n        },\n        {\n            "unit_id": 1,\n            "time": "...",\n            "atomic_fact": ["...", "..."]\n        }\n    ]\n}\n\n**Critical Rules:**\n- Process ALL narratives in order (unit_id must match input)\n- Do NOT skip any unit\n- Ensure valid JSON output\n\nReturn only the JSON object:\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-4.1-mini', 'max_tokens': 32768, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}, 'temperature': 0}}
