an reassured him that they were fine. Evan explained that although the accident was minor, it somewhat dampened his experience of telling his work friends about his marriage. Despite this, Evan noted that his work friends had been very supportive."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 229,\n    "timestamp": "December 31, 2023(Sunday) at 11:02 AM",\n    "narrative": "At 11:02 AM on December 31, 2023 (Sunday), Sam commented that Evan\'s work friends were likely thrilled to hear about his marriage despite the accident. Evan agreed, describing the period as a whirlwind of emotions and expressing relief that the accident was minor. He reflected on the importance of taking it easy on the road. Sam emphasized the importance of safety and expressed gladness that Evan could still enjoy peaceful moments after the incident. Evan agreed, stating that nature brings peace and clarity and is a great experience. Sam added that nature helps put everything else into perspective and helps find inner peace by reminding people of the bigger picture."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 230,\n    "timestamp": "December 31, 2023(Sunday) at 11:04 AM",\n    "narrative": "At 11:04 AM on December 31, 2023 (Sunday), Evan shared a photo of a woman sitting at a table with plates and glasses, stating that nature had been a great healer for him. He mentioned wanting to share some new healthy snacks he had been trying. Sam complimented the snacks as healthy and delicious, noting they were perfect for after a hike or post-accident recovery. Evan then shared a photo of cookies cooling on a rack, explaining that the cookies were nutrient-packed, easy to make, and offered to send Sam the recipes. Sam expressed appreciation and asked if Evan had any other healthy snack ideas. Evan shared another photo showing a bowl of coconut balls and a bowl of oats, describing a recipe for energy balls he had discovered. Sam asked if Evan liked them, acknowledging that they could be an acquired taste. Evan confirmed he enjoyed them, highlighting that they were energizing and a healthy way to satisfy a sweet tooth. Sam expressed enthusiasm for the healthy snack tips and thanked Evan. Evan hoped Sam would enjoy the recipes."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 231,\n    "timestamp": "December 31, 2023(Sunday) at 11:09 AM",\n    "narrative": "On December 31, 2023 (Sunday) at 11:09 AM, Sam thanked Evan for the healthy snack recipes and said he would give them a try. Sam remarked that the snacks looked delicious and expressed gratitude for Evan\'s help."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 232,\n    "timestamp": "December 31, 2023(Sunday) at 11:09 AM",\n    "narrative": "Also at 11:09 AM on December 31, 2023 (Sunday), Sam shared that he had gone to the store again and, unsurprisingly, encountered issues with the self-checkout, describing it as a regular annoyance. Evan responded that he had never experienced problems with self-checkout. Sam joked that he seemed to attract such issues and offered to be called by Evan if he ever wanted to experience similar problems at the store."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 233,\n    "timestamp": "January 06, 2024(Saturday) at 01:32 PM",\n    "narrative": "On January 6, 2024 (Saturday) at 1:32 PM, Evan shared a photo of himself and his partner standing on a rocky beach with Sam. Evan revealed that he and his partner had told their extended family about their marriage the previous day (January 5, 2024), describing the occasion as very special. Evan expressed feeling overwhelmed by the love and support from their families. Sam congratulated Evan, complimented the happiness evident in the photo, and expressed excitement for Evan\'s joyful moment."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 234,\n    "timestamp": "January 06, 2024(Saturday) at 01:33 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 1:33 PM on January 6, 2024 (Saturday), Evan thanked Sam and described the moment of sharing their marriage news as awesome. He expressed feeling lucky to have found a partner who truly understands him and emphasized how happy their families were about the marriage, calling that the best part. Sam responded by acknowledging how great it was that Evan had found someone who understood him and noted the comfort that family support brings. Evan agreed, emphasizing the importance of family support and how it brought a good feeling to their lives. Sam concurred, stating that family brings love and happiness and is always there no matter what. Evan reiterated that family is special because of their never-ending love and support. Sam agreed, noting that both he and Evan have amazing families who are always there for them, calling it a blessing. Evan echoed this sentiment, saying their families provide joy, support, and love, and he could not imagine life without them. Sam shared that his own family had been his rock through everything. Evan shared a photo of a group of people sitting at a table with food, agreeing that families are their rock and that they are blessed to have them."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 235,\n    "timestamp": "January 06, 2024(Saturday) at 01:38 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 1:38 PM on January 6, 2024 (Saturday), Sam complimented Evan and his family, asking what was cooking that night. Evan replied that they were having a family get-together and enjoying homemade lasagna, expressing excitement. Evan also mentioned that he had started a new diet limiting himself to just two ginger snaps a day and asked Sam what was on his menu that evening."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 236,\n    "timestamp": "January 06, 2024(Saturday) at 01:39 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 1:39 PM on January 6, 2024 (Saturday), Evan repeated that he had started a new diet limiting himself to two ginger snaps daily and asked Sam about his dinner plans. Sam shared a photo of a plate with bread and meat, complimented Evan\'s discipline, and said they were keeping dinner light with homemade lasagna. Sam humorously noted that his meal could not compete with Evan\'s ginger snap limit."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 237,\n    "timestamp": "January 06, 2024(Saturday) at 01:40 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 1:40 PM on January 6, 2024 (Saturday), Evan acknowledged that Sam\'s dinner looked hearty and delicious but affirmed his commitment to stick to his diet plan even during the family gathering."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 238,\n    "timestamp": "January 06, 2024(Saturday) at 01:40 PM",\n    "narrative": "Also at 1:40 PM on January 6, 2024 (Saturday), Sam shared a photo of a pie topped with raspberries and limes, teasing Evan that it looked delicious. Evan responded that it looked yummy and asked if Sam had made it. Sam clarified that he had not made the pie; it was a photo from his cousin\'s wedding and described it as super special."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 239,\n    "timestamp": "January 06, 2024(Saturday) at 01:42 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 1:42 PM on January 6, 2024 (Saturday), Evan shared a photo of a wedding cake decorated with candles and flowers on a table, commenting that weddings are indeed special and the cake looked great. Sam responded by complimenting the cake and noting it reminded him of special occasions. Sam then asked Evan if he had any upcoming plans."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 240,\n    "timestamp": "January 06, 2024(Saturday) at 01:43 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 1:43 PM on January 6, 2024 (Saturday), Evan shared a photo of a stream running through a snowy forest and told Sam that he and his partner were going to Canada next month (February 2024) for their honeymoon. Evan expressed excitement about creating awesome memories and exploring the beautiful snowy landscapes. When Sam asked about their plans for the trip, Evan explained that they planned to ski, try local cuisine, and enjoy the beautiful views, emphasizing their excitement."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 241,\n    "timestamp": "January 06, 2024(Saturday) at 01:44 PM",\n    "narrative": "At 1:44 PM on January 6, 2024 (Saturday), Sam shared a photo of a container of caramel-covered french fries and commented that Evan\'s honeymoon plans sounded amazing, highlighting skiing, trying local dishes, and enjoying breathtaking views as the perfect combination. Evan mentioned he was looking forward to trying poutine while in Canada. Sam noted that he had never tried poutine and acknowledged it as a Canadian specialty, asking Evan to let him know how he liked it. Evan agreed to keep Sam posted on whether poutine lived up to the hype. Sam encouraged Evan to share all the details and wished him an incredible trip. Evan thanked Sam and reciprocated the good wishes."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 242,\n    "timestamp": "January 10, 2024(Wednesday) at 12:17 AM",\n    "narrative": "At 12:17 AM on January 10, 2024 (Wednesday), Evan reached out to Sam, hoping he was doing well and mentioning that something funny had happened the previous night (January 9, 2024). Sam responded promptly, asking Evan what had happened and inviting him to share the story."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 243,\n    "timestamp": "January 10, 2024(Wednesday) at 12:18 AM",\n    "narrative": "At 12:18 AM on January 10, 2024 (Wednesday), Evan explained to Sam that he had gone out with friends the previous day (January 9, 2024) and had consumed a bit too much alcohol. He admitted to doing something he regretted that involved someone\'s roses. Sam asked for more details about the incident and whether everything was okay now."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 244,\n    "timestamp": "January 10, 2024(Wednesday) at 12:19 AM",\n    "narrative": "At 12:19 AM on January 10, 2024 (Wednesday), Evan confessed that he had an embarrassing accident where he urinated near some roses. He apologized for the incident. Sam reacted with concern, asking if anyone had been upset and whether Evan was okay."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 245,\n    "timestamp": "January 10, 2024(Wednesday) at 12:20 AM",\n    "narrative": "At 12:20 AM on January 10, 2024 (Wednesday), Evan recounted that he was very embarrassed when he saw the consequences the next morning. He apologized to the affected parties, who were understanding. Evan acknowledged that he had been out of control and resolved to be more careful in the future. Sam expressed relief that the others were understanding and reminded Evan that everyone makes mistakes because they are human."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 246,\n    "timestamp": "January 10, 2024(Wednesday) at 12:21 AM",\n    "narrative": "At 12:21 AM on January 10, 2024 (Wednesday), Evan reiterated that the people involved had been understanding, which he appreciated. He reflected that the incident was a good reminder to be more careful and emphasized the importance of learning from mistakes."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 247,\n    "timestamp": "January 10, 2024(Wednesday) at 12:21 AM",\n    "narrative": "Also at 12:21 AM on January 10, 2024 (Wednesday), Evan shared that he and his partner had tried snowshoeing over the past weekend (January 6-7, 2024) as part of a new adventure, finding it surprisingly fun. Sam responded by sharing a photo of a whiteboard covered with writing, agreeing that mistakes happen but it is important to learn from them. Sam also shared that he had created a meal plan and workout schedule, motivated by something he had seen, and was committed to staying on track starting that day."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 248,\n    "timestamp": "January 10, 2024(Wednesday) at 12:22 AM",\n    "narrative": "At 12:22 AM on January 10, 2024 (Wednesday), Evan praised Sam for having a plan and dedication to staying healthy. Evan suggested that Sam consult his doctor for advice, as a medical professional could provide additional diet and exercise tips. Sam thanked Evan and acknowledged that he had not seen a doctor in a while but agreed it was a good idea to make an appointment soon."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 249,\n    "timestamp": "January 10, 2024(Wednesday) at 12:23 AM",\n    "narrative": "At 12:23 AM on January 10, 2024 (Wednesday), Evan asked Sam what advice he planned to seek from the doctor. Sam replied that he intended to ask about a balanced diet plan and to get recommendations for low-impact exercises suitable for his current situation."\n  },\n  {\n    "unit_id": 250,\n    "timestamp": "January 10, 2024(Wednesday) at 12:24 AM",\n    "narrative": "On January 10, 2024 (Wednesday) at 12:24 AM, Evan shared a photo of a salad containing chicken, avocado, tomatoes, corn, and cheese with Sam. Evan encouraged Sam by saying the salad was a step in the right direction and reminded Sam to focus on maintaining a balanced diet alongside low-impact exercises. Evan asked Sam to keep him updated on the progress. Sam responded positively, complimenting the salad and inquiring about the inspiration behind it. Additionally, Sam requested suggestions for low-impact exercises to complement the diet."\n  }\n]\n\n---\n\n### EXTRACTION RULES\n\n#### 1. Atomicity\n* Each entry in `"atomic_fact"` must express **exactly one coherent unit of meaning** — an action, emotion, reason, plan, decision, or statement.\n* If a speaker expresses multiple ideas (e.g., an event and its reason), split them into multiple atomic facts.\n* Each atomic_fact must be **independent and retrievable on its own**.\n\n#### 2. Time & Date Handling\n* Do **not** add or prepend timestamps such as "On March 10, 2024" to each fact.\n* The `"time"` field already represents the episode\'s start time.\n* However, when the original text mentions **explicit or relative time expressions**, you must:\n  - **Preserve** explicit dates verbatim (e.g., "October 6, 2023").\n  - **Resolve** relative or vague times (e.g., "yesterday", "last week", "two months ago") relative to the timestamp, and **append the resolved absolute date in parentheses**.\n    Example: "Gina said she launched the campaign yesterday (March 9, 2024)."\n  - If the exact resolution is uncertain, use a normalized vague phrase (e.g., "in early 2023", "during the summer of 2021") instead of guessing.\n\n#### 3. Content Preservation\n* Preserve **all semantically