vering adjacent periods to handle off-by-one-week errors**\n- Keep queries 6-15 words each\n\n**Output Format** (strict JSON):\n{\n  "queries": [\n    "First query focusing on entities and action",\n    "Second query with event synonyms",\n    "Third query covering adjacent time periods"\n  ],\n  "reasoning": "Brief explanation (1 sentence)"\n}\n\nNow generate queries:\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-4.1-mini', 'max_tokens': 32768, 'response_format': {'type': 'json_object'}, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}, 'temperature': 0.0}}
