dding Photo and Life Update with Sam After Time Apart\n  Content: On December 26, 2023 (Tuesday) at 4:25 PM, Sam greeted Evan, noting it had been a long time since they last connected and asked how he was doing. Evan responded by sharing a photograph of a bride and groom kissing in front of a tree, revealing that he had gotten married the previous week (around December 19, 2023). Evan admitted that life had been up and down lately and asked Sam how he was doing.\n\nDocument 4:\n  Title: Sam Congratulates Evan on Marriage and Confirms Bride’s Identity\n  Content: At 4:26 PM on December 26, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam congratulated Evan on his recent marriage and asked if the woman in the photo was the one from Canada. Evan confirmed that she was and expressed surprise that they had not married earlier, explaining that he had been in love with her at first sight.\n\nDocument 5:\n  Title: Evan Shares Wedding Cake Photo and Sam Inquires About Upcoming Plans\n  Content: At 1:42 PM on January 6, 2024 (Saturday), Evan shared a photo of a wedding cake decorated with candles and flowers on a table, commenting that weddings are indeed special and the cake looked great. Sam responded by complimenting the cake and noting it reminded him of special occasions. Sam then asked Evan if he had any upcoming plans.\n\nDocument 6:\n  Title: Evan Shares Deep Family Values and Future Plans with Sam\n  Content: At 1:49 PM on December 9, 2023 (Saturday), Evan expressed to Sam how much his family means to him, describing them as his rock. He shared his anticipation for expanding their family and creating more beautiful memories together. Sam responded positively, affirming that it was wonderful to hear and recognizing how much Evan values his family.\n\nDocument 7:\n  Title: Evan shares exciting news of partner’s pregnancy; Sam congratulates and praises parenthood\n  Content: On December 9, 2023 (Saturday) at 1:45 PM, Evan contacted Sam to share wonderful news: his partner was pregnant. Evan express