2025-12-18 01:56:16,994 - [search-v4-locomo_8_qa94] - openai._base_client - DEBUG - _base_client.py:482 - Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'headers': {'Connection': 'close'}, 'timeout': 300.0, 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-03bfb887-cba4-4b54-8775-873086553afb', 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'You are a meticulous and detail-oriented expert in information retrieval evaluation. Your task is to critically assess whether a set of retrieved documents contains sufficient information to provide a direct and complete answer to a user\'s query.\n\n**User Query**:\nWhat kind of water does Evan suggest Sam try as an alternative to soda?\n\n**Retrieved Documents**:\nDocument 1:\n  Title: Sam Admits No Diet Changes, Evan Suggests Healthier Alternatives\n  Content: At 3:56 PM on June 6, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam admitted that he had not made any changes to his diet and was still enjoying soda and candy, though he acknowledged these were not good habits. Evan empathized with the difficulty of breaking habits and suggested small changes that could have a big impact over time. He recommended swapping soda for flavored seltzer water to maintain a bubbly, tasty drink without sugar and replacing candy with dark chocolate with high cocoa content as a healthier option. ...\n\nDocument 2:\n  Title: Evan Encourages Sam to Try Flavored Seltzer Water and Mentions Reading a Mystery Novel\n  Content: Also at 10:55 AM on July 27, 2023 (Thursday), Evan shared a photo of a table displaying various sodas and water bottles, encouraging Sam to replace soda with flavored seltzer water as a healthier alternative. Evan motivated Sam by acknowledging the initial difficulty but expressed confidence in Sam’s ability to succeed. Additionally, Evan mentioned that he was engrossed in a new mystery novel that he found very gripping.\n\nDocument 3:\n  Title: Sam Asks for Low-Calorie Snack Suggestions and Inquires About Evan’s Novel\n  Content: At 10:56 AM on July 27, 2023 (Thursday), Sam responded positively to Evan’s suggestion about flavored seltzer water, noting he had tried it before and liked it. Sam then asked Evan for ideas on low-calorie snacks to accompany the seltzer water and inquired about the title of the novel Evan was reading.\n\nDocument 4:\n  Title: Evan Recommends Healthy Snacks and Reveals He Is Reading "The Great Gatsby"\n  Content: At 10:56 AM on July 27, 2023 (Thursday), Evan shared a photo of a table with bowls of fruit and a bottle of alcohol, suggesting that flavored seltzer water paired with air-popped popcorn or fruit would be a tasty and healthy snack option. Evan also revealed that the novel he was reading was "The Great Gatsby."\n\nDocument 5:\n  Title: Sam advises low-impact exercises for Evan\'s knee; Evan swims and awaits PT\n  Content: On August 27, 2023 (Sunday) at 10:20 AM, Sam reflected on life\'s unpredictability and emphasized the importance of adaptability and finding alternative ways to stay active when facing obstacles. Sam suggested Evan consider low-impact exercises or physical therapy for his knee. Sam also expressed interest in the book Evan mentioned. Evan confirmed that physical therapy was planned and hoped to get an appointment soon. Meanwhile, Evan was keeping activity low-key by swimming, which he found suitab...\n\nDocument 6:\n  Title: Sam endorses yoga benefits; offers support and tips to Evan\n  Content: Also at 8:19 PM on December 5, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam responded that the Weight Watchers meeting had been insightful and that the smoothie bowl was well received. Sam strongly recommended yoga, sharing that it had greatly improved his flexibility and reduced his stress levels. He encouraged Evan to try it and offered to provide yoga tips or other support if needed. Evan expressed gratitude and confirmed he would try yoga, appreciating Sam’s suggestion.\n\nDocument 7:\n  Title: Evan Praises Lake Tahoe as Kayaking Destination; Sam Looks Forward 