assuring him that every bit counted and that he would reach his goals. Sam appreciated Evan\'s support, stating it meant a lot to have Evan in his corner.\n\n[Memory 17] (ID: 2af05544-5031-4bf9-adab-be842ef8b146, Score: 0.0274)\nAlso at 7:53 PM on August 7, 2023 (Monday), Evan humorously remarked that life can throw unexpected things at a person, sharing a lighthearted comment about his current situation. Sam responded by noting that dealing with health problems can be challenging and can detract from enjoyable experiences.\n\n[Memory 18] (ID: 0c4b57aa-aaa7-4ede-aa2f-1adf2a90793b, Score: 0.0270)\nAt 7:53 PM on August 7, 2023 (Monday), Evan shared a photo of a container of cookies on a counter and thanked Sam for his kind words. Evan described his new relationship as fun and energizing, a refreshing change especially after dealing with health issues.\n\n[Memory 19] (ID: a5928194-d6ec-4a51-bc91-003a34a1df4c, Score: 0.0269)\nAt 4:10 PM on August 13, 2023 (Sunday), Evan expressed sympathy for Sam\'s difficulties and offered help, acknowledging that dealing with health issues can be tough. Sam replied by sharing a photo of a notepad with a pen and a note, thanking Evan for his support and explaining that staying positive was hard but easier knowing people like Evan were in his corner.\n\n[Memory 20] (ID: d89588b9-3a21-429e-ad3b-0aa2d63e4ecc, Score: 0.0265)\nAlso at 3:55 PM on June 6, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam mentioned that he was trying to eat healthier these days. Evan complimented the salad Sam shared and explained that he was being extra careful with his health, trying to reduce processed foods and sugary snacks despite his fondness for ginger snaps. Evan asked Sam if he had made any recent dietary changes.\n\n\n\nQuestion: What health issue did Sam face that motivated him to change his lifestyle?\n\nNow, follow the Chain-of-Thought process above to answer the question:\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-4.1-mini', 'max_tokens': 16384, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': 