m agreed, noting that both he and Evan have amazing families who are always there for them, calling it a blessing. Evan echoed this sentiment, saying their families provide joy, support, and love, and he could not imagine life without them. Sam shared that his own family had been his rock through everything. Evan shared a photo of a group of people sitting at a table with food, agreeing that families are their rock and that they are blessed to have them.\n\n[Memory 9] (ID: 199f1ed0-b8a8-4cd8-bc6e-345c1dc64984, Score: 0.0431)\nAt 6:54 PM on December 17, 2023 (Sunday), Evan shared a photo of a woman standing in front of a painting. He explained that trying something new and succeeding brings a great feeling of accomplishment. Evan encouraged Sam to give it a try, even if it is just a small effort, assuring him that he would be amazed by the results.\n\n[Memory 10] (ID: dfa1de4f-b2e4-44fa-8bd4-3c6159bee286, Score: 0.0421)\nAt 4:27 PM on December 26, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam reacted to Evan’s story of love at first sight, describing it as something out of a fairy tale. Sam asked Evan if he believed in love at first sight. Evan affirmed his belief, describing the experience as if time had stopped and a spark had ignited inside him, making it feel completely right. Sam expressed enthusiasm, acknowledging how liberating it must feel to find such a connection and reflecting on the powerful nature of love.\n\n[Memory 11] (ID: 391dbe07-59a6-4c84-b59a-8faf2ca192b9, Score: 0.0286)\nAt 12:27 AM on January 10, 2024 (Wednesday), Evan shared a photo of a woman standing on a beach at sunset, suggesting that there are many enjoyable low-impact exercises beyond yoga, including beach walks. Evan described beach sunsets as both good exercise and calming experiences. Sam responded that the image looked zen and said he planned to try beach walks based on Evan\'s recommendation. Sam also shared that he had a recurring dream of flying over skyscrapers, which he wanted to brag about.\n\n[Memory 12] (ID: 31024ec1-8100-4555-bf51-2cb4352fa587, Score: 0.0282)\nOn January 6, 2024 (Saturday) at 1:32 PM, Evan shared a photo of himself and his partner standing on a rocky beach with Sam. Evan revealed that he and his partner had told their extended family about their marriage the previous day (January 5, 2024), describing the occasion as very special. Evan expressed feeling overwhelmed by the love and support from their families. Sam congratulated Evan, complimented the happiness evident in the photo, and expressed excitement for Evan\'s joyful moment.\n\n[Memory 13] (ID: abf17dac-c175-4338-acf4-6b4333ab5326, Score: 0.0278)\nAlso at 08:59 PM on October 6, 2023 (Friday), Evan shared an anecdote about an event that occurred two weeks prior (around September 22, 2023). He had helped a lost tourist find their way, which unexpectedly turned into a spontaneous tour around the city. Evan described the experience as a blast. Sam responded positively, noting how helping others can lead to unexpected adventures.\n\n[Memory 14] (ID: 49270e99-17e1-43e4-8426-e87231ec757a, Score: 0.0268)\nOn January 11, 2024 (Thursday) at 9:37 PM, Sam reached out to Evan after a few days without contact, expressing concern about his health issues that had made life difficult. Sam described feeling weighed down by his health problems, which hindered his ability to fully live, but he was trying to stay positive despite the challenges. Evan responded empathetically, acknowledging the difficulty of health interfering with life and commended Sam\'s positivity while reminding him to take care of himself.\n\n[Memory 15] (ID: 250d7631-f71f-4c4a-8c47-690422d963b9, Score: 0.0256)\nAt 11:04 AM on December 31, 2023 (Sunday), Evan shared a photo of a woman sitting at a table with plates and glasses, stating that nature had been a great healer for him. He mentioned wanting to share some new healthy snacks he had been trying. Sam complimented the snacks as healthy and delicious, noting they were perfect for after a hike or post-accident recovery. Evan then shared a photo of cookies cooling on a rack, explaining that the cookies were nutrient-packed, easy to make, and offered to send Sam the recipes. Sam expressed appreciation and asked if Evan had any other healthy snack ideas. Evan shared another photo showing a bowl of coconut balls and a bowl of oats, describing a recipe for energy balls he had discovered. Sam asked if Evan liked them, acknowledging that they could be an acquired taste. Evan confirmed he enjoyed them, highlighting that they were energizing and a healthy way to satisfy a sweet tooth. Sam expressed enthusiasm for the healthy snack tips and thanked Evan. Evan hoped Sam would enjoy the recipes.\n\n\n\nQuestion: How does Evan describe the woman and his feelings for her that he met in Canada?\n\nNow, follow the Chain-of-Thought process above to answer the question:\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-4.1-mini', 'max_tokens': 16384, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}, 'temperature': 0}}
