 and said they were keeping dinner light with homemade lasagna. Sam humorously noted that his meal could not compete with Evan\'s ginger snap limit.\n\n[Memory 17] (ID: 7f05ee0f-3875-45d3-b516-3902552b0bc3, Score: 0.0280)\nAt 09:28 AM on September 11, 2023 (Monday), Sam asked Evan if he had seen the before-and-after photos he posted showing the results of his diet, explaining that he was working to motivate others to make better choices. Evan responded enthusiastically, expressing love for the photos and stating that making healthier choices had made a significant difference for him as well. Evan reflected on how small changes can have a big impact and asked Sam if the diet was making a difference for him too.\n\n[Memory 18] (ID: 3d5bf21a-dcff-4409-aadb-1ccb82b51ae8, Score: 0.0274)\nAt 1:38 PM on January 6, 2024 (Saturday), Sam complimented Evan and his family, asking what was cooking that night. Evan replied that they were having a family get-together and enjoying homemade lasagna, expressing excitement. Evan also mentioned that he had started a new diet limiting himself to just two ginger snaps a day and asked Sam what was on his menu that evening.\n\n\n\nQuestion: What new diet and lifestyle change did Sam adopt over time?\n\nNow, follow the Chain-of-Thought process above to answer the question:\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-4.1-mini', 'max_tokens': 16384, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}, 'temperature': 0}}
