fe.\n\n[Memory 3] (ID: 4dfa21f7-da6e-4dd9-9be2-973d2daeec9f, Score: 0.0465)\nOn November 21, 2023 (Tuesday) at 07:30 PM, Sam reached out to Evan after a long time, asking how he was doing and hoping all was well. Evan responded that life had been a wild ride lately. He shared that the previous week (November 14-20, 2023), he experienced a health scare that required a hospital visit. During a check-up, something suspicious was found, which frightened Evan. Fortunately, it turned out to be a misunderstanding. This experience made Evan realize the importance of monitoring his health closely.\n\n[Memory 4] (ID: fbe9c621-102b-4d56-98b2-3c7bb5648996, Score: 0.0465)\nAt 7:31 PM on November 21, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam confided to Evan that he had been experiencing some physical discomfort that was limiting his movement. Sam mentioned efforts to improve his condition through dietary changes, though he acknowledged the difficulty in maintaining these changes. Evan empathized with Sam\'s situation, recognizing how challenging it is when health issues hold someone back. Evan encouraged Sam by expressing belief in his ability to improve through small, manageable steps.\n\n[Memory 5] (ID: 9f5f44c4-e19b-46cc-b29d-b94fb6a4844b, Score: 0.0452)\nOn June 6, 2023 (Tuesday) at 3:55 PM, Evan reached out to Sam after a period of no contact, sharing that life had been a rollercoaster lately. Evan disclosed a recent health scare involving a sudden heart palpitation incident the previous week (around May 30, 2023), which served as a serious wake-up call about his lifestyle. Sam responded with a photo of a plate of vegetables and a glass of milk, expressing gladness that Evan was feeling better.\n\n[Memory 6] (ID: 2af05544-5031-4bf9-adab-be842ef8b146, Score: 0.0450)\nAlso at 7:53 PM on August 7, 2023 (Monday), Evan humorously remarked that life can throw unexpected things at a person, sharing a lighthearted comment about his current situation. Sam responded by noting that dealing with health prob