times being impatient for quick results but recognized the need for patience. Evan emphasized that progress takes time and advised taking it one step at a time. Sam agreed, appreciating the advice to take it slow rather than overdoing it, and expressed gratitude for Evan\'s support.\n\n[Memory 3] (ID: fb253bfa-ac7c-4a08-8270-64b0ac364cdc, Score: 0.0472)\nOn October 17, 2023 (Tuesday) at 1:50 PM, Sam reached out to Evan, expressing that he had been missing their chats. Sam revealed that he had experienced a significant health scare the previous weekend (last weekend, October 7-8, 2023), which resulted in an emergency room visit due to a severe stomachache. The diagnosis was gastritis, which alarmed Sam and served as a wake-up call to prioritize his health. Sam mentioned plans to adopt a more nutritious diet and engage in regular exercise. Additionally, Sam shared that his phone had been malfunctioning, adding to his stress. Evan responded with sympathy, acknowledging that gastritis can be tough and emphasizing the importance of taking care of oneself.\n\n[Memory 4] (ID: 3cb95a3a-9f97-46ad-8996-5ad40e9cd764, Score: 0.0462)\nOn October 8, 2023 (Sunday) at 03:09 PM, Sam reached out to Evan to share a personal concern. Sam revealed that during a medical check-up the previous Monday (October 2, 2023), his doctor had warned that his weight posed a serious health risk and that without changes, the situation could worsen. Although Sam had previously joked about his weight, the news was now hitting him hard, and he admitted to having a difficult time coping.\n\n[Memory 5] (ID: 3dccb320-89ad-498a-9cb0-335408925164, Score: 0.0446)\nAt 4:09 PM on October 14, 2023 (Saturday), Evan empathized with Sam about work stress and asked if Sam had tried anything new to de-stress, suggesting that picking up a hobby might help. Sam responded by expressing interest in trying something different outdoors and asked Evan for suggestions, indicating a willingness to explore new stress-relief activities.\n\n[Memory 6] (ID: 7083f6cf-9422-4226-8f57-d84e41cc70c2, Score: 0.0441)\nAlso at 6:51 PM on December 17, 2023 (Sunday), Sam confided in Evan that he was struggling with his weight, which was negatively affecting his confidence. He expressed feelings of lacking motivation and difficulty overcoming the challenges related to his weight.\n\n[Memory 7] (ID: aba6dd0a-f703-40d9-bb8c-e1e6dd33b15f, Score: 0.0302)\nOn August 15, 2023 (Tuesday) at 04:25 PM, Sam shared with Evan that he had been feeling a mix of emotions, including concern about his health but also motivation to make positive changes. Sam emphasized his approach of taking things one step at a time. Evan responded empathetically, acknowledging that feeling overwhelmed is normal and encouraged Sam to continue moving forward slowly with small steps, affirming that Sam was doing an awesome job.\n\n[Memory 8] (ID: 7d77db47-4216-4f8e-b6a6-97f9bfa3b5e1, Score: 0.0294)\nAt 09:31 AM on September 11, 2023 (Monday), Evan shared an image of a painting depicting a mountain range with a horse. He related to Sam\'s experience by saying that when he was stressed, he also sought comfort. Evan shared that he found painting or going for a drive helpful as coping mechanisms.\n\n[Memory 9] (ID: 58e15b0a-3ce4-438a-9d49-8e4ede2b5fe0, Score: 0.0280)\nAlso at 09:30 AM on September 11, 2023 (Monday), Sam explained that his cravings were usually triggered by stress, boredom, or a desire for comfort. He acknowledged how tempting sugary treats could be.\n\n[Memory 10] (ID: fbe9c621-102b-4d56-98b2-3c7bb5648996, Score: 0.0277)\nAt 7:31 PM on November 21, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam confided to Evan that he had been experiencing some physical discomfort that was limiting his movement. Sam mentioned efforts to improve his condition through dietary changes, though he acknowledged the difficulty in maintaining these changes. Evan empathized with Sam\'s situation, recognizing how challenging it is when health issues hold someone back. Evan encouraged Sam by expressing belief in his ability to improve through small, manageable steps.\n\n[Memory 11] (ID: 7d0d047c-7b97-4b4f-be15-ea8807845529, Score: 0.0272)\nAt 09:04 PM on October 6, 2023 (Friday), Sam shared his frustration with his new phone, specifically that its navigation app frequently malfunctioned, making it challenging to get around. Evan responded by complimenting Sam\'s writing as a great form of self-expression and asked what kind of writing Sam enjoyed.\n\n[Memory 12] (ID: 803fac33-3d15-45db-8b19-f3aa0288b4a5, Score: 0.0265)\nAt 09:00 PM on October 6, 2023 (Friday), Sam asked Evan about the progress of his watercolor painting. Evan shared a photo of a painting depicting a cactus in the desert, stating that painting had been going well and served as an effective stress reliever. He mentioned that the painting was completed the previous week (last week, September 29, 2023).\n\n\n\nQuestion: What kind of stress was Sam dealing with in October 2023?\n\nNow, follow the Chain-of-Thought process above to answer the question:\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-4.1-mini', 'max_tokens': 16384, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}, 'temperature': 0}}
