ed that his work friends had been very supportive.\n\n[Memory 18] (ID: 8ca960fd-da8f-4834-b7b4-ceb964c74840, Score: 0.0258)\nAt 4:14 PM on October 14, 2023 (Saturday), Evan complimented Sam\'s choice of Lake Tahoe for kayaking, describing it as an awesome pick with clear water and gorgeous views. Evan encouraged Sam to have a blast and to take lots of pictures. Sam thanked Evan and expressed that he was looking forward to the trip, showing excitement and appreciation.\n\n\n\nQuestion: When did Evan and Sam planned a trip to the beach together?\n\nNow, follow the Chain-of-Thought process above to answer the question:\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-4.1-mini', 'max_tokens': 16384, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}, 'temperature': 0}}
