ns and recommended exercise as an additional necessary component.\n\n[Memory 20] (ID: ca8ab68c-b566-4585-aacd-6258fa0eab42, Score: 0.0253)\nOn September 11, 2023 (Monday) at 09:28 AM, Evan reached out to Sam after a long period without communication. Evan shared an image of a painting depicting a sunset over a body of water and asked Sam what he had been doing over the past few weeks.\n\n\n\nQuestion: How did Evan get into watercolor painting?\n\nNow, follow the Chain-of-Thought process above to answer the question:\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-4.1-mini', 'max_tokens': 16384, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}, 'temperature': 0}}
