pressing hope that all was well. Sam replied with a photo of a person holding a box of sodas in front of a wall, admitting that he had experienced a rough week. Sam confessed that he gave in and bought some unhealthy snacks, which made him feel guilty.\n\n[Memory 16] (ID: cccb3361-1af1-4223-b6a1-c63d03f440e2, Score: 0.0258)\nAt 8:17 PM on December 5, 2023 (Tuesday), Evan elaborated that he had been counting on the new Prius to be reliable, and dealing with unexpected issues was challenging. He accepted that even new cars can have problems. Sam offered a positive perspective, suggesting that setbacks like this can sometimes lead to new opportunities. Evan agreed and expressed that he was trying to view the situation as a chance to explore alternative ways to stay active and travel, possibly trying something different.\n\n[Memory 17] (ID: c81fd716-8102-4102-ac46-6f9c40aad333, Score: 0.0257)\nAt 06:32 PM on August 19, 2023 (Saturday), Sam expressed a wish to join in the winter fun, acknowledging that it sounded awesome. Evan invited Sam to join him someday, emphasizing that winter activities were a blast and expressing hope that Sam would be able to participate in the future. Sam responded that it was difficult due to physical limitations but appreciated Evan\'s understanding, saying it meant a lot to him.\n\n[Memory 18] (ID: 5d6865cb-bdd2-4ca2-bf2f-c6609d3020fb, Score: 0.0255)\nAt 10:55 AM on July 27, 2023 (Thursday), Sam confirmed that he was actively reducing his consumption of soda and candy. He acknowledged that this was a difficult process but expressed determination to make these healthy changes.\n\n\n\nQuestion: What frustrating issue did Sam face at the supermarket?\n\nNow, follow the Chain-of-Thought process above to answer the question:\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-4.1-mini', 'max_tokens': 16384, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}, 'temperature': 0}}
