emories X and Y]\n  - Weak evidence: [possible inference] - limited support from [memory Z]\n\n## STEP 4: TIME REFERENCE CALCULATION\n[Parse time expressions in BOTH the question AND the memories]\n\n**A. QUESTION TIME PARSING:**\nIf the question contains relative time expressions, calculate the exact date:\n- "before [date]" means PRIOR TO that date, not the date itself\n- "after [date]" means FOLLOWING that date, not the date itself\n- "as of [date]" means at or before that date, not after\n- When a weekday is specified with before/after, find the nearest matching weekday in that direction\n\nQuestion time reference (if any):\n- Original expression: [the time phrase from the question]\n- Calculated date range: [the exact date or range it refers to]\n\n**B. MEMORY TIME CONVERSION:**\n[Convert relative times in memories to absolute dates based on conversation timestamp]\n\n**C. TIME MATCHING:**\n[Match the calculated question time with events in memories]\n- Events within timeframe: [list]\n- Events outside timeframe: [list, if any - these should be excluded]\n\n## STEP 5: COMPLETENESS CHECK (Critical for List Questions)\n**If the question asks for multiple items (what...did, which, what kind of):**\n- [ ] Searched all memories for relevant items (not just first few)\n- [ ] Cross-referenced different memories for the same entity\n- [ ] Included specific details (e.g., "pet shelter" not just "volunteering")\n- [ ] Excluded planned/considered items that weren\'t executed (for past tense questions)\n- [ ] Verified temporal constraints (e.g., "as of date X" excludes items after X)\n\n**If the question asks for a specific fact/date/number:**\n- [ ] Found the most specific information available\n- [ ] Verified temporal accuracy (right time point)\n- [ ] Checked for contradictions across memories\n\n## STEP 6: CONTRADICTION CHECK\n[If multiple memories contain different information]\n- Conflicting information: [describe]\n- Resolution: [explain which is most recent/reliable, or acknowledge uncertainty]\n\n## STEP 7: DETAIL VERIFICATION CHECKLIST\n- [ ] All person names included: [list them]\n- [ ] All locations included: [list them]\n- [ ] All numbers exact: [list them]\n- [ ] All frequencies specific: [list them]\n- [ ] All dates/times precise: [list them]\n- [ ] All items/activities complete (for list questions): [list them]\n- [ ] All proper nouns preserved: [list them]\n\n## FINAL ANSWER:\n[Provide a clear, complete answer with ALL specific details preserved]\n\n**Answer Guidelines:**\n- For factoid questions (who/when/where): Keep concise (1-2 sentences)\n- For list questions (what...did, which, what kind of): Include ALL items found, with specifics\n- For "how many" questions: Give the exact number, then optionally list items\n- For inference questions: Provide reasoning based on concrete evidence\n- Always prioritize COMPLETENESS and ACCURACY over brevity\n\n---\n\n[Memory 1] (ID: 55667a3b-6b84-4080-bce7-bb77204d1878, Score: 0.0492)\nAt 4:29 PM on December 26, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam admitted that he had not experienced love in the same way but had started enjoying running in the mornings as a way to clear his head. Evan responded by sharing a photo of a painting with a white background featuring blue, orange, and black colors. He acknowledged Sam’s approach to life, emphasizing the importance of finding what works for oneself. Evan encouraged Sam to keep trying new things, suggesting that he might find his own version of love in unexpected places and urged him to embrace the journey, which is full of surprises.\n\n[Memory 2] (ID: 6dfd531c-eb84-4b2b-a205-da0bb919f30f, Score: 0.0468)\nAlso at 1:55 PM on May 18, 2023 (Thursday), Evan encouraged Sam by saying that he would find a hobby he loved by continuing to try new things until something sparked his excitement.\n\n[Memory 3] (ID: 129ebcf4-72c3-47d2-aec6-a8ebf3c395fa, Score: 0.0457)\nAlso at 3:16 PM on October 8, 2023 (Sunday), Evan reassured Sam that he was there for him and advised him to keep taking one step at a time. Evan expressed confidence that by doing so, Sam would eventually reach his goals, promoting a patient and steady approach.\n\n[Memory 4] (ID: 7fa56183-9d04-4838-b1cb-65d243a22aea, Score: 0.0444)\nOn October 25, 2023 (Wednesday) at 03:02 PM, Evan advised Sam to take his health journey one day at a time and celebrate small victories. Sam agreed that focusing on small wins was a good plan and committed to taking it one day at a time. Evan congratulated Sam on every little victory and reaffirmed his support. Sam expressed that Evan\'s support meant everything to him and toasted to moving forward. Evan encouraged Sam to keep pushing ahead and offered ongoing help, wishing Sam to take care.\n\n[Memory 5] (ID: d8922c50-2533-4cf1-8216-c73d4ccc813f, Score: 0.0422)\nAt 04:26 PM on August 15, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam thanked Evan for his encouragement, expressing that it meant a lot to him. Sam reiterated his commitment to keep going and take things one step at a time. Evan reassured Sam by repeating the advice to keep going with small steps and expressed confidence that Sam would reach his goals. Sam responded again with gratitude, emphasizing how much Evan\'s support meant to him.\n\n[Memory 6] (ID: 6d9f8dc4-a216-410c-8035-a4831c81491d, Score: 0.0421)\nAt 7:16 PM on May 24, 2023 (Wednesday), Sam thanked Evan for the encouragement and committed to trying painting, promising to update Evan on how it went. Evan responded enthusiastically, advising Sam to have fun and not put too much pressure on himself. Sam agreed to enjoy the process without stress. Evan encouraged Sam to keep him updated, and Sam promised to do so before they exchanged goodbyes.\n\n[Memory 7] (ID: dfa1de4f-b2e4-44fa-8bd4-3c6159bee286, Score: 0.0407)\nAt 4:27 PM on December 26, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam reacted to Evan’s story of love at first sight, describing it as something out of a fairy tale. Sam asked Evan if he believed in love at first sight. Evan affirmed his belief, describing the experience as if time had stopped and a spark had ignited inside him, making it feel completely right. Sam expressed enthusiasm, acknowledging how liberating it must feel to find such a connection and reflecting on the powerful nature of love.\n\n[Memory 8] (ID: 6f66ad4f-6870-4d71-aea5-6c231e5227f2, Score: 0.0296)\nOn October 25, 2023 (Wednesday) at 02:56 PM, Sam told Evan that he had been trying to maintain his new health routine but found it tough due to pressure from his family. Evan acknowledged the importance of encouragement but cautioned against stress from others. Evan also shared that he had just returned from his morning walk, which helped him start the day actively. Sam agreed that having a great support system made things easier and thanked Evan for his support. Evan encouraged Sam to take it slow and treat himself kindly. Sam admitted sometimes being impatient for quick results but recognized the need for patience. Evan emphasized that progress takes time and advised taking it one step at a time. Sam agreed, appreciating the advice to take it slow rather than overdoing it, and expressed gratitude for Evan\'s support.\n\n[Memory 9] (ID: 2829f750-a1f2-40f0-8dba-d6fe6ae5a2d7, Score: 0.0293)\nAt 6:53 PM on December 17, 2023 (Sunday), Evan acknowledged that stepping out of one’s comfort zone can be intimidating but reassured Sam that it is worthwhile. Evan advised Sam to challenge himself to try something new, even if it is a small step. Sam thanked Evan and agreed to take his advice, though he noted that trying new things can be difficult.\n\n[Memory 10] (ID: 8467c014-d097-4afd-af90-aec4379f7e70, Score: 0.0292)\nAt 3:57 PM on June 6, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam agreed that Evan\'s ideas were good and said he would give them a try. Evan encouraged Sam to keep him informed about how it went, emphasizing that small changes could significantly improve health and that every step mattered. Sam thanked Evan and promised to keep him posted. Evan expressed his commitment to supporting Sam on their respective health journeys, reminding Sam that progress takes time. Sam acknowledged this and expressed readiness to keep trying and making small changes. Evan motivated Sam to keep up the effort, assuring him that every bit counted and that he would reach his goals. Sam appreciated Evan\'s support, stating it meant a lot to have Evan in his corner.\n\n[Memory 11] (ID: c6785ce5-5410-45be-b02d-59ae20df0b80, Score: 0.0287)\nAt 6:51 PM on December 17, 2023 (Sunday), Evan recalled that Sam had mentioned his love for hiking before. He emphasized that hiking is a great way to center oneself and connect with nature. Evan proposed that they should definitely plan a hike together soon.\n\n[Memory 12] (ID: 255bf297-4f37-41d7-bc3d-68eace473861, Score: 0.0277)\nOn August 27, 2023 (Sunday) at 10:23 AM, Sam said that although he had not gone on a road trip in a long time, he loved being surrounded by nature because it was tranquil and refreshing. Sam expressed a desire to hike more but noted it could be challenging. He mentioned working on becoming healthier and hoped that a road trip and hike might be possible soon. Evan shared a photo of a lake with a mountain in the background and said that nature was peaceful. Evan recommended hiking more, as he did, describing it as calming and fun. Evan proposed that they should go hiking together sometime.\n\n[Memory 13] (ID: c12668ff-1c90-46f2-94d3-4876c8894666, Score: 0.0277)\nAt 1:33 PM on January 6, 2024 (Saturday), Evan thanked Sam and described the moment of sharing their marriage news as awesome. He expressed feeling lucky to have found a partner who truly understands him and emphasized how happy their families were about the marriage, calling that the best part. Sam responded by acknowledging how great it was that Evan had found someone who understood him and noted the comfort that family support brings. Evan agreed, emphasizing the importance of family support and how it brought a good feeling to their lives. Sam concurred, stating that family brings love and happiness and is always there no matter what. Evan reiterated that family is special because of their never-ending love and support. Sam agreed, noting that both he and Evan have amazing families who are always there for them, calling it a blessing. Evan echoed this sentiment, saying their families provide joy, support, and love, and he could not imagine life without them. Sam shared that his own family had been his rock through everything. Evan shared a photo of a group of people sitting at a table with food, agreeing that families are their rock and that they are blessed to have them.\n\n[Memory 14] (ID: 852d8e71-4f0f-482f-ae2c-3066d02e7495, Score: 0.0269)\nContinuing at 7:32 PM on November 21, 2023 (Tuesday), Evan expressed that he was focusing on enjoying the present moment. Sam responded enthusiastically, suggesting that they make it a habit to appreciate something each day. This exchange revealed their mutual desire to cultivate mindfulness and gratitude in daily life.\n\n\n\nQuestion: What did Evan suggest Sam should keep doing to find his own version of love?\n\nNow, follow the Chain-of-Thought process above to answer the question:\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-4.1-mini', 'max_tokens': 16384, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}, 'temperature': 0}}
