t had been a long time since they last connected, and asked what was new with Evan.\n\n[Memory 14] (ID: 46987ff9-f47e-46e6-b9e1-e0ed29f69dc9, Score: 0.0280)\nOn January 10, 2024 (Wednesday) at 12:26 AM, Evan emphasized that yoga was a great starting point for Sam, sharing that yoga had helped him manage stress and maintain flexibility, which complemented a healthy diet well. Evan also acknowledged The Godfather as a legendary film worth multiple viewings. Sam expressed hope that combining a healthier diet with yoga would lead to positive changes in his well-being.\n\n[Memory 15] (ID: a365303c-bdc1-4f01-a90e-e0e519c3ac4e, Score: 0.0277)\nAt 1:39 PM on January 6, 2024 (Saturday), Evan repeated that he had started a new diet limiting himself to two ginger snaps daily and asked Sam about his dinner plans. Sam shared a photo of a plate with bread and meat, complimented Evan\'s discipline, and said they were keeping dinner light with homemade lasagna. Sam humorously noted that his meal could not compete with Evan\'s ginger snap limit.\n\n[Memory 16] (ID: 94db81d9-3819-4236-9665-bb021a583c78, Score: 0.0267)\nAt 7:15 PM on May 24, 2023 (Wednesday), Evan shared that what worked for him was finding a fitness routine he genuinely enjoyed, which became his go-to activity. He loved the feeling of being healthy and strong. Evan emphasized making exercise fun and incorporating small smarter dietary choices that added up over time. He encouraged Sam by affirming that Sam had the capability to succeed.\n\n[Memory 17] (ID: 938c817f-8fb8-466b-bf22-b443f0cf8113, Score: 0.0264)\nAt 10:57 AM on July 27, 2023 (Thursday), Evan shared a photograph of a book with a green apple beside it, symbolizing health and knowledge. He encouraged Sam to concentrate on making healthy swaps and taking small, manageable steps toward better health, advising Sam to stay positive and upbeat throughout the process.\n\n[Memory 18] (ID: fec7ac28-e6ad-472a-8b38-dbf112117136, Score: 0.0263)\nOn October 25, 2023 (W