what. Although he could not perform intense workouts, Evan was doing gentle exercises to maintain strength, noting that it was not as fulfilling as outdoor activities but still beneficial.\n\n[Memory 11] (ID: 6f79af9c-c78d-4bce-9978-5dd9d0329f9d, Score: 0.0308)\nAt 1:43 PM on January 6, 2024 (Saturday), Evan shared a photo of a stream running through a snowy forest and told Sam that he and his partner were going to Canada next month (February 2024) for their honeymoon. Evan expressed excitement about creating awesome memories and exploring the beautiful snowy landscapes. When Sam asked about their plans for the trip, Evan explained that they planned to ski, try local cuisine, and enjoy the beautiful views, emphasizing their excitement.\n\n[Memory 12] (ID: 0176f4c3-0bb7-4e76-b8dc-92de50966b77, Score: 0.0301)\nAlso on December 31, 2023 (Sunday) at 11:00 AM, Evan told Sam that he and his partner had taken their Prius for a long drive to the mountains the previous weekend (December 23-24, 2023). The trip was perfect until they experienced a minor accident on the way back. Sam expressed concern about their well-being, and Evan reassured him that they were fine. Evan explained that although the accident was minor, it somewhat dampened his experience of telling his work friends about his marriage. Despite this, Evan noted that his work friends had been very supportive.\n\n[Memory 13] (ID: bb56d93e-569c-4f98-81f9-d2da6752eab9, Score: 0.0287)\nOn August 27, 2023 (Sunday) at 10:20 AM, Sam reflected on life\'s unpredictability and emphasized the importance of adaptability and finding alternative ways to stay active when facing obstacles. Sam suggested Evan consider low-impact exercises or physical therapy for his knee. Sam also expressed interest in the book Evan mentioned. Evan confirmed that physical therapy was planned and hoped to get an appointment soon. Meanwhile, Evan was keeping activity low-key by swimming, which he found suitable for his condition. Sam agreed that swimming was a good choice because it is low-impact, easy on the joints, and refreshing, encouraging Evan to maintain his active lifestyle.\n\n[Memory 14] (ID: 31024ec1-8100-4555-bf51-2cb4352fa587, Score: 0.0278)\nOn January 6, 2024 (Saturday) at 1:32 PM, Evan shared a photo of himself and his partner standing on a rocky beach with Sam. Evan revealed that he and his partner had told their extended family about their marriage the previous day (January 5, 2024), describing the occasion as very special. Evan expressed feeling overwhelmed by the love and support from their families. Sam congratulated Evan, complimented the happiness evident in the photo, and expressed excitement for Evan\'s joyful moment.\n\n[Memory 15] (ID: 816b1c3e-762a-4816-a424-836783262dc5, Score: 0.0276)\nAlso at 03:09 PM on October 8, 2023 (Sunday), Evan responded by sharing a photo of himself performing a squat on a gym machine. He acknowledged that health challenges could be discouraging. Evan described how he had started lifting weights one year ago and found it to be a challenging but rewarding journey, noting visible progress. Evan offered to support Sam if he was interested in trying weightlifting.\n\n[Memory 16] (ID: c81fd716-8102-4102-ac46-6f9c40aad333, Score: 0.0274)\nAt 06:32 PM on August 19, 2023 (Saturday), Sam expressed a wish to join in the winter fun, acknowledging that it sounded awesome. Evan invited Sam to join him someday, emphasizing that winter activities were a blast and expressing hope that Sam would be able to participate in the future. Sam responded that it was difficult due to physical limitations but appreciated Evan\'s understanding, saying it meant a lot to him.\n\n[Memory 17] (ID: a3d4c150-cd8f-493d-be3f-f56cf2172565, Score: 0.0272)\nAt 4:12 PM on October 14, 2023 (Saturday), Evan expressed enthusiasm about planning a kayaking trip together and promised to pick a cool spot. Sam shared a photograph showing a row of kayaks lined up on the shore of a river, confirming his excitement and readiness for the activity. Sam thanked Evan for his help and looked forward to the planned kayaking adventure.\n\n[Memory 18] (ID: efbffc38-e07d-40d7-9b15-3402833135e3, Score: 0.0258)\nAt 1:44 PM on January 6, 2024 (Saturday), Sam shared a photo of a container of caramel-covered french fries and commented that Evan\'s honeymoon plans sounded amazing, highlighting skiing, trying local dishes, and enjoying breathtaking views as the perfect combination. Evan mentioned he was looking forward to trying poutine while in Canada. Sam noted that he had never tried poutine and acknowledged it as a Canadian specialty, asking Evan to let him know how he liked it. Evan agreed to keep Sam posted on whether poutine lived up to the hype. Sam encouraged Evan to share all the details and wished him an incredible trip. Evan thanked Sam and reciprocated the good wishes.\n\n\n\nQuestion: What sports activity did Evan and his partner try in a recent weekend?\n\nNow, follow the Chain-of-Thought process above to answer the question:\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-4.1-mini', 'max_tokens': 16384, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}, 'temperature': 0}}
