Tuesday), Sam shifted the conversation back to Evan, asking how he was doing following his health scare. Evan responded positively, stating that he was doing well and that doctors had confirmed everything was fine. He reflected that the experience taught him the value of life. Evan also commented on the movie Sam had mentioned, expressing interest in it. This moment underscored Evan\'s recovery and his renewed appreciation for life.\n\n[Memory 12] (ID: fbe9c621-102b-4d56-98b2-3c7bb5648996, Score: 0.0278)\nAt 7:31 PM on November 21, 2023 (Tuesday), Sam confided to Evan that he had been experiencing some physical discomfort that was limiting his movement. Sam mentioned efforts to improve his condition through dietary changes, though he acknowledged the difficulty in maintaining these changes. Evan empathized with Sam\'s situation, recognizing how challenging it is when health issues hold someone back. Evan encouraged Sam by expressing belief in his ability to improve through small, manageable steps.\n\n[Memory 13] (ID: b2c7ffb8-3e6d-48a9-ade3-bf4747fd3bd2, Score: 0.0277)\nAlso at 03:10 PM on October 8, 2023 (Sunday), Evan encouraged Sam by emphasizing the importance of starting with proper form and technique. He recommended finding a trainer to help avoid injuries while building strength. Evan advised starting with light weights and gradually increasing intensity as strength improved. He stressed the importance of consistency in the workout routine and invited Sam to keep him updated on his progress, wishing him good luck.\n\n[Memory 14] (ID: 129ebcf4-72c3-47d2-aec6-a8ebf3c395fa, Score: 0.0269)\nAlso at 3:16 PM on October 8, 2023 (Sunday), Evan reassured Sam that he was there for him and advised him to keep taking one step at a time. Evan expressed confidence that by doing so, Sam would eventually reach his goals, promoting a patient and steady approach.\n\n[Memory 15] (ID: bc5d733b-128a-4c09-bac8-79033da247ac, Score: 0.0269)\nAlso at 4:16 PM on August 13, 2023 (Sunday), Sam thanked Evan for the suggestion to look into dream interpretation. Sam reflected that the journey toward better health felt endless at times but was convinced it would be rewarding in the end. Sam wished Evan good luck with finding his keys.\n\n[Memory 16] (ID: fb253bfa-ac7c-4a08-8270-64b0ac364cdc, Score: 0.0264)\nOn October 17, 2023 (Tuesday) at 1:50 PM, Sam reached out to Evan, expressing that he had been missing their chats. Sam revealed that he had experienced a significant health scare the previous weekend (last weekend, October 7-8, 2023), which resulted in an emergency room visit due to a severe stomachache. The diagnosis was gastritis, which alarmed Sam and served as a wake-up call to prioritize his health. Sam mentioned plans to adopt a more nutritious diet and engage in regular exercise. Additionally, Sam shared that his phone had been malfunctioning, adding to his stress. Evan responded with sympathy, acknowledging that gastritis can be tough and emphasizing the importance of taking care of oneself.\n\n[Memory 17] (ID: 49270e99-17e1-43e4-8426-e87231ec757a, Score: 0.0258)\nOn January 11, 2024 (Thursday) at 9:37 PM, Sam reached out to Evan after a few days without contact, expressing concern about his health issues that had made life difficult. Sam described feeling weighed down by his health problems, which hindered his ability to fully live, but he was trying to stay positive despite the challenges. Evan responded empathetically, acknowledging the difficulty of health interfering with life and commended Sam\'s positivity while reminding him to take care of himself.\n\n\n\nQuestion: What advice did Evan suggest Sam seek from a doctor?\n\nNow, follow the Chain-of-Thought process above to answer the question:\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-4.1-mini', 'max_tokens': 16384, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}, 'temperature': 0}}
